<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Saaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Saŋ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Saaŋ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Saaŋ fiis</para>
  <para style="mt">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Saaŋ fiis</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Saaŋ ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu. Saaŋ na Saak na Piyeer ɓeɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci uup woyu ŋ teereeci nikiis ci na naandsuke kipes kiŋ Yeesu. Marka Saaŋ ŋ Limiŋ tiik ci. Saaŋ, ŋ ɗooƴ teerndi a fiis, a teek haf ce "taalubeeni Yeesu keeñkohe".<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:20">Saaŋ 21:20</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 21:24">24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ finho kakaan ki na hulti na rapɗuukiŋ Yeesu, a yi taambkohee Maryaama, yaayiŋ Yeesu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:25-27">Saaŋ 19:25-27</ref></char></note> Ŋ mirndaani a yi adgohee ɓi Jangu, ŋ ɗiska woysee Asi ŋ jamanoonaam (ɓak ngaŋ ɗiski Turki nik woti-woti). Ŋ jamanoonaam, weɗ a fiisoh teerndii, na fiis ci kaahay ci a kaɓɗoh<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1">1 Saaŋ</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1">2 Saaŋ</ref>; <ref loc="3JN 1">3 Saaŋ</ref></char></note> na teerndi na woye ŋ in ci na haye ŋ fikiiri.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1">Teeɓ ki</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Saaŋ woyiɗ ŋ teerndii findi Yeesu puloh ɗafka, a hayya kehƴi, na in ci a haɓiɗ ŋ kehƴi, na in ci a jangɗoh, na kakaan kiŋ ɗe na hultiŋ ɗe. Yeesu yegɗeen ɓooɓa woo kiŋ Kooh, a wirɗeeɗa kosaayiɗ ca, a tumeeɗa in feyohiɗ ca uupee haf caŋ ɓooɓa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ini a fiis, wa hun na ini Macce na Maarko na Luk fiis, waaye fiisohaaɗi ɗalohiɗ. Saaŋ a yi uupiɗ Macce na Maarko na Luk ini a naandsuk ŋ ɓaaɓ ciŋ Yeesu ŋ harmban Galile na Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Saaŋ fiis kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Ini Yeesu nik keeh-keeh <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Seedeeniŋ <char style="w">Yahya</char> ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-34">1:19-34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kiis ci Yeesu tumohee pangkiŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:35-12:50">1:35–12:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Yeesu ɗaayiɗ na taalubeeciŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13-17">13–17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ambuuka, atte'uuka na kakaan kiŋ Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 18-19">18–19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Hultiŋ Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-18">20:1-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Teeɓkaŋ Yeesu ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ciŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:19-21:23">20:19–21:23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Reehɗohaani <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:24-25">21:24-25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Woo ki</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Ŋ camba, wa raak Woo ki nikiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:1">Woo ki nikee na Kooh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:1">te wa nikka a yi.<verse eid="JHN 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Wa nikee na Kooh, ŋ camba.<verse eid="JHN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Kooh taamboh ŋ Woo ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:3">a ferra in ci jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:3">raakɗi ini feru te wa lahɗi ŋ Woo ki.<verse eid="JHN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ŋ ɗooƴ Woo ki, kipes nikee nga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:4">kipes keem siñaariɗta ŋ ɓooɓi.<verse eid="JHN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Siñaari siñaarɗiɗ ŋ ñuusi te ñuusi ambɗaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Raakka ɓoyi Kooh woos,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:6">a teeksee <char style="w">Yahya</char>.<verse eid="JHN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>A hayya findi seede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:7">ne a seede siñaari, ɓooɓi jen kos saguuce.<verse eid="JHN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>A yi nikee siñaari haa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:8">waaye a hay ne a seede siñaari.<verse eid="JHN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Siñaari keeh-keeheem</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:9">siñaariɗ ɓo' nu nik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:9">siñaareem nikee hayeeɗa Adina.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>A yi Woo ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:10">a nikka ŋ ɗooƴ adinaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:10">adinaani feru taamboh nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:10">waaye Adina inhisɗi ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>A hayya ŋ ɓooɓiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:11">waaye ɓooɓiŋ ɗe teyɗukɗi ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Waaye ɓi teyɗuk ɗe jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:12">te ɓa kossa ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:12">a oniɗ ɓa ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:12">ɓa min nik kuɓuuciŋ Kooh.<verse eid="JHN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Ɓa rimukɗi ŋ ɓo',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">ɓa rimukɗi sagu ne a ɓo' waaɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:13">waaye ɓa rimuk ŋ Kooh.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Woo ki nikka ɓo',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">ɓoyeem gennda na ɓoo ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">a riiffa na baahoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">a riiffa na keeh ki ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">ɓoo hotta yaki a yak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">yakki Baabi eɗ <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:14">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe yino-kongi.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yahya seede'ɗiɗ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">woosa ŋ ɗafka ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">« A yi ŋ woyee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">wa ŋ woyee ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">“ Yi na haye ŋ finhooso</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">a yi uup po yak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">laam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:15">a nikiɗ bala ŋ nikan. ” »<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>A riifiɗ na baahoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:16">te ɓoo jen rahsiɗ ŋ baahohiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:16">wi minɗi reeh.<verse eid="JHN 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Nakoh ciŋ Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">a lahɗoh ca ŋ <char style="w">Musaa</char> ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">waaye baahohiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">na ini kaɗ nga ɗe keeh-keeh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:17">a Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> hay na ca.<verse eid="JHN 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Ali ɓo' moosɗi hotoh Kooh ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">a Kuɓki yino-kongi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">te a yi Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">a reɓpa ŋ Baabi lool,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:18">a yi teeɓoh ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Ini Yahya seede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Wa raakka mbeh, kilifaaciŋ Yawuut caŋ Yerusalem woossa ɓi ɓo' ŋ Yahya, ɓooɓi ɓa woosee ɓaah ŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> na <char style="w">Lewiici</char>, ne ɓa meekis ɗe ne : « A fu ɓa ? » Yahya seede inii, <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>a ɗasɗohɗi ɓa ali in, a woo ɓa keeh ki, a woo ɓa halang ne : « A ñam <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> haa. » <verse eid="JHN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Ɓa meeksissa ɗe ne : « Kon a fu ɓa ? A fu <char style="w">Ilyas</char> e ? » A loffa ɓa ne : « A'aa, a ñam haa. » Ɓa meeksissa ɗe ne : « A fu Woosuuɗi joy hay e<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Rohƴiɗi 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> ? » A lofissa ne : « A'aa. »<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Ŋ ineem ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kon a fu ɓa ? Ɓoo joyiɗ raak ini ɓoo wikan ɓi woos ɓoo. Fu woo ye ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗa ? » <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « A ñam hoosoori woosuuɗi Esayi woye, ɓoyi na leehke ŋ bilaf fa ne : “ Haɓɗaat waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo, wa yurah ! ” »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esayi 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Ɓi <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ɓaaheen ŋ ƴaaɓa woossee ŋ Yahya, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>ɓa meekissa Yahya ne : « Nik ne a fu Mucɗohi Gapohse haa, a fu Ilyas haa te a fu Woosuuɗi joy hay haa ɗah, kon wa ye tah fu ɓoktohe ? » <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Mi na ɓoktohe ŋ masuɓ waaye, ŋ harmban ɗu raakiɗ yi ɗu inahɗi ; <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>te a yi hay ŋ finhooso. Ŋ yeyyooɗi ɗe sah toksiɗ liiɓ ciŋ ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Ineem raakoh ŋ Betani, Betaniina nik ŋ ɓaka faahaŋ kalaŋ Yurdan, ɗiska Yahya ɓoktohe.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu a yi Mbaaliŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina Yahya hotta Yeesu hayeeɗa nga ɗe, a woosa ne : « Mbaaliŋ Kooh yeɗɗi, yi na nihse bakaaɗ ciŋ adinaani. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>A yi ŋ woyee, wa ŋ woyee ne : “ Raakiɗ ɓoyi na haye ŋ finhooso, a yi uup po yak, laam a nikiɗ bala ŋ nikan. ” <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Mi sah, ŋ inheeɗi ɓoyi a nikoh, waaye, ne ŋ teeɓ cuuɓiŋ Israayel ɗe, weɗ tah ho hay, ŋ ɓoktohee ŋ masuɓ. »<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Yahya seede inii : « Ŋ hotiɗ <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> ruhsohha Eel ci findi banuut, nikka nga ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Ŋ inheeɗi ne a yi, waaye, Kooh yi woos so ne ŋ ɓoktoh na masuɓ a yi woyee so ne : “ Yi fu na hee hote Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ruhus, gen nga ɗe, a yi ɓoktohan na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. ” » <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Yahya degga nga ne : « Ineem ŋ degiɗa has te ŋ seede'iɗ ne a yi Kuɓkiŋ Kooh. »<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taalubeeciŋ Yeesu koc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina Yahya nikissa ŋ ndaam na taalube kanak ŋ ɓiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>A hotta Yeesu kaɗeeɗa, a woosa ne : « Mbaaliŋ Kooh yeɗɗi ! » <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Taalubeeca kanak ca kerahha woo keem, ɓa ñaakiɗta Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Yeesu heelukka, a hotta ne ɓa ɗii ñaakiɗ ɗe, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na waake ye ? » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « <char style="tl">Rabbi</char>, fu gen nde ? » ("<char style="tl">Rabbi</char>" weɗ "jangɗohohi"). <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Hayaat, ɗu hot. » Ɓa kaɗta, ɓa hotta ɗiska a gen. Ineem nikee ŋ ɓak noh soos, ɓa nikka na ɗe nga ŋ ina tasee ŋ mbehaam jen.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Andare taambɗoh Simong Piyeer, ɓaahee ŋ taalubeeci kanak ceem. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>A koc kaɗ ŋ Simong, taambɗoh ce, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo hotiɗ Kiristaani ! » Kiristaani, a yi Mucɗohi Gapohse. <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>A ɓayya Simong ŋ Yeesu. Yeesu marakka ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « A fu Simong, kuɓkiŋ Saaŋ ; te fu ɓeeɗkohsan Sefas. » Sefas weɗ Piyeer, wa tokis atoh.<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓeeɗkiɗ Filip na Natanayel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Ŋ Kooh-wiisiina, Yeesu tufukka ŋ kot kaɗ Galile, a hotta Filip, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ñaakiɗ to ! » <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filip genee Betsayda, kur ka Andare na Piyeer puloh. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filip hotta Natanayel, a woosa ɗe ne : « Yi waasiŋ Musaa na woosuuɗ ci woo ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗe, ɓoo hotiɗ ɗe, a Yeesu kuɓu Suseef. A gen Nasareet. » <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanayel woosa ɗe ne : « Nasareet i ? In baahiɗ miniɗ puloh Nasareet e ? » Filip woosa ɗe ne : « Haya fu hot. »<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Wa Yeesu hot Natanayel hayeeɗa nga ɗe, a woosa nga ɗe an : « Ɓo' Israayel keeh-keeh a yi, a inahɗi lee. » <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanayel woosa ɗe ne : « Fu inhoh ho nde ? » Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ hotee nga ɗa wa fu nik ŋ ooɓ nduna, bala Filip ɓeeɗkan ɗa ɗah. » <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanayel woyissa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, a fu Kuɓkiŋ Kooh, a fu buuriŋ Israayel ! » <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ini ŋ woo ɗa ne ŋ hotiɗ ɗa ŋ ooɓ nduna weɗ tah ɗa kos e ? Fu hey hotisse ɓi in wiiriis ci uup yak ! »<verse eid="JHN 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>A ɓaatta nga ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, te ambaat ne wa keeh : Ɗu hey hote Asamaan rangsukiɗ, malaakaaciŋ Kooh rapee nga, ca ruhsee ŋ <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> ! »<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kilooka nikee ŋ Kanaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Wa ineem deg neeh kanak, kilook raakka ŋ kur ka na woyse Kanaa ngaŋ Galile. Yaay ɓi Yeesu nikee nga. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yeesu nameen ɓeeɗku nga, a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Ɓa nikka ŋ kilooka po biiña reehha, yaay ɓi Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓa raakisɗi biiñ. » <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>A loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓit, fu waaɗ ye nga so ? Wahtuuniŋ ngo reeɗi paaɗ. » <verse eid="JHN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Yaay ɓa woosa surgaaca ne : « In nu a woo ɗu ɗah, tumaata. »<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Ndaam raakeen kiro yasna-yino haɓɗohu atoh, ceɗ Yawuut ca meeɗ njirñiɗkoh ne ɓa farsukee ɗah ; waa nu nga ɗah ɗaleen ree <char style="tl">liitar</char> teemet wala ini uupa. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yeesu woosa surgaaca ne : « Neyaat kiroocii po ca riif. » Ɓa neyya ca po ca riiffa tem. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Hafaat nga, ɗu kom ƴaari adgoh kañam ki. » Ɓa tummba ɗaa.<verse eid="JHN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Wa ƴaara ƴooha, raak wa ɓoƴsuuɗ biiñ. Surgaaca neyee masma inheen ɗiska wa puloh, waaye a inheeɗaa. A ɓeeɗukka ƴaara kilookee, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>a woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓooɓi jen na adge eɗoh biiñi uup neɓ, wa kaɗta po ɓooɓi dohrohha ɗah, wi tas neɓ han eɗohu. Waaye fu nak, fu ɗaak ɗaak wi uup neɓ po wahtuunii. »<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Wa nikka firndeeni Yeesu koc teeɓoh, wa raakoh kur kaŋ Kanaa ngaŋ Galile. Ɗaa, a teeɓohha yaki a yak, taalubeeciŋ ɗe kossa ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Wa ineem coot, Yeesu hunnda na yaay ɓa, na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ƴaar ci, na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, ɓa kaɗta kur ka na woyse Kapernawum. Ɓa nikka nga ɓi neeh.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu aañiɗ toonoh ca ŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Waam raak feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paakiŋ</char></char> Yawuut ci heeɗa ree, Yeesu kaɗta Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>A raakka ɓi toonoh inoh na mbaal na banuut ngaŋ ɗooƴ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> ; a nammba raak ɓi wecce'oh kopor ɓoofiɗ na taaɓul caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>A tokiɗta leraw, a aannja ɓa jen po ɓa pulla Kahan Kooh na mbaal caŋ ɓa na inoh ca. A pasarsohha kopor caŋ wecce'oh ca, a folla taaɓul caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>A woosa toonoh banuut ca ne : « Nihsaat in cii jen ndii, kinaat tum kahan Baabiŋ ngo ɗisik toonoha ! »<verse eid="JHN 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe naandsukka ini Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo wii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 2:17">« Kooh ! Sawri ŋ sawar ŋ kahan fu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 2:17">wa ɗii ap po.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Sabuur 69:10</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca woosa ɗe ne : « Fu eɗan ɓoo winde firnde, wi min teeɓoh ne ini fu tum wa waas ? » <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Pooksohaat Kahniŋ Kooh wii, ŋ kurkiɗisa ŋ neeh kaahay. » <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Taɓahuukiŋ Kahniŋ Kooh wii tumiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis na kiis yasna-yino (46), an fu heya kurkiɗisse ŋ neeh kaahay i ? »<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Waaye Kahniŋ Kooh Yeesu woye, a faaniŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Weɗ tah wa a hultiɗu, taalubeeciŋ ɗe naandsukka ne a meeɗeena woo. Ɓa kossa Fiis ci, ɓa kossa ina Yeesu woye.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yeesu nikee ŋ Yerusalem ŋ feetaŋ <char style="tl">Paaka</char>. Wa ɓooɓa hot firndeeca a haɓɗe, laayiɗ kossa ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Waaye a inheen ɓa jen, tahha po a oolkeeɗi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Yeesu ŋ haf ce, a inhiɗ ini nik ŋ keeñ ɓo', tahha po a etohɗi ne ɓo' teeɓ ɗe in ngaŋ ɓo'.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Nikodem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Raakeen ƴaar teeku Nikodem, a ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca te a nikee kilifa Yawuut. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>A hayya ŋ Yeesu na wek a woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓoo inhiɗ ne a Kooh woos ɗa ne fu jangiɗ ɓoo ; laam ali ɓo' minɗi haɓiɗ firndeeci fu na haɓɗe ne Kooh hunɗi na ɗe ɗah. »<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗa wa, te amba ne wa keeh : Ɓo' nu rimkisɗi ɗah, a minɗi ɓaah ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. »<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodem meekissa ɗe ne : « Ɓoyi kaɗ po yaɓko'iɗ, a min na rimkohis ? A miniɗ aasis ŋ rookiŋ yaayiŋ ɗe, a rimkis e ? »<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yeesu loffa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗa wa te amba ne wa keeh, ɓo' nu rimukɗi rimki puloh ŋ masuɓ na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> ɗah, a minanɗi aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>In nu rimkoh ŋ ɓo' ɗah, wa ɓay kipes ɓo', in nu rimkoh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ɗah, wa ɓay kipes kiŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Kina feyu ŋ ini ŋ woo ɗa ne : “ Ɗu joyiɗ rimkis. ” <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Puuɗsi na laɓe ŋ ɗisik nu wa waaɗ ɗah. Fu kerhee wa waaye fu inhuu ɗiski wa puloh na ɗiski wa na kee. Wa mand ɗaa ŋ ɓo' nu rimkoh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ɗah. »<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodem meeksissa ɗe ne : « Ineem min na nikoh ? »<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohoh hend na ɗa ŋ ɗooƴ Israayel po fu inahɗi ineem e ? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Ñam woo ɗa wa te amba ne wa keeh, ɓoo na woye ini ɓoo inah, ɓoo seede'ee ini ɓoo hot, te ɗu na teyɗukeeɗi seedeeniŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Ŋ woyee ɗu in ciŋ kehƴi, ɗu kosɗi so ɗah, ɗu kosohan ndo na, ne ŋ woo ɗu in caŋ ɗafka ɗah ?<verse eid="JHN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Ali ɓo' rapɗi ŋ ɗafka, ɗal <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char>, yi ruhsoh nga. <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Te findi <char style="w">Musaa</char> meeɓohee iiña moosa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:8-9">Kind ci 21:8-9</ref></char></note> ŋ kehƴa hulanga ne ɓooɓa hot ɗe, Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi joyiɗ meeɓohu ɗaa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>ne ɓo' nu kos ɗe ɗah, raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe. »<verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Kooh waaɗiɗ adinaani po a eɗohha <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> yino-kongi ne ɓo' nu kos Kuɓki ɗah, fu sooƴuu, waaye fu raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Laam Kooh woosɗi Kuɓkiŋ ɗe ŋ Adina ne a atte ɓi Adina, waaye ne Adina min mucɗu taamboh nga ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Yaa nu kos ɗe ɗah, atte'sanɗi. Waaye yaa nu kosɗi ɗe ɗah, a atte'uuɗ po ƴutiɗ ŋ kosaaɗiiki a kosaaɗi Kuɓkiŋ Kooh yino-kongi.<verse eid="JHN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Atteeni weɗɗi : Siñaari hayiɗ Adina, waaye ɓooɓi, a ñuusi ngisohiɗ ɓa siñaari sagu ne tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa moɗɗi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Tumoh moɗaaɗiici jen, sangiɗ siñaari, te ɓa hayanɗi nga, ɓa neƴƴoh ne in ci ɓa na tume hotu noh cong. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Waaye ɓi na pese ŋ keeh ki na haye ŋ siñaari, ne ɓooɓi min hot ne ini ɓa na haɓɗe, kurkoh ŋ Kooh.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Yahya Ɓoktohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Wa in ceem coot, Yeesu kaɗta kur caŋ Yudee na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ; a nikka na ɓa nga neeh caam, a ɓoktoheeɗa. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/><char style="w">Yahya</char> nameeɗa ɓoktoh ŋ Enon ŋ sero Salim, ndaam nikee ɗisik laayiɗ masuɓ ; ɓooɓa kaɗeeɗa ne ɓa ɓoktuk. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Waam raak Yahya taƴuuɗi ŋ kaso paaɗ.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Wa raakka mbeh taalubeeciŋ ɗe taastiɗoheeɗa na ƴaar ŋ Yawuut ca ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ findi ɓa na farsukohe. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Ɓa hayya ŋ Yahya ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ƴaari nikee na ɗa ŋ ɓaka faahaŋ Yurdan, te fu seedeesa ɗe, ɗiski wa nik, a yaa ɓoktoheeɗa te ɓooɓi jen ɓaa kaɗ nga ɗe de'. »<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yahya loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' minɗi raak ali in ne Kooh eɗɗi ɗe wa ɗah. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Ɗu, ɗu miniɗ to seede ne ŋ woyiɗ ne : Ñam <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> haa, waaye ŋ woosu ne ŋ adug ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Kilooki, wuu heɗ kilooki ; waaye nawle heɗ kilooki, yi nik ŋ sero heɗ kilooki te a sikɗukee ɗe, na sume sum lool ne a kerah hoosooriŋ ɗe ɗah. Sumeem weɗ sumi ŋ sum woti te ɗiski wa nik, wa mitiɗ. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>A yi, a joy joy ɓaat yak a kaɗe, mi, ŋ uupee ƴissuut. »<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yi puloh ɗafki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Yi puloh ɗafki, a yi uup ɗafuk ɓooɓi jen ; yi puloh kehƴi a wuu kehƴi, te a na woye in ciŋ kehƴi. Ee di', Yi puloh Asamaan, [a yi uup ɗafuk ɓooɓi jen.] <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>A na woye ini a hot te a kerahhaa waaye ɓooɓi teyɗukɗi seedeeniŋ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Yi teyɗuk seedeeniŋ ɗe teeɓohiɗ ne a huniɗ ne in nu Kooh woo ɗah, wa keeh. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Yi Kooh woos, a na onee ɗe on Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani te Fuuɗsi a on ɗe na topeeɗi, tahha po in ci a na woye, ca woo ciŋ Kooh. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Baabi waaɗiɗ Kuɓki te a degiɗ jen ŋ yaah ce. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Yi kos Kuɓki, a raakiɗ kipes ki heyɗi reehe. Yi sang kerhiɗ Kuɓki, a raakanɗi kipes ki keeh-keehi te ayrukiŋ Kooh genan na ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na ɓitɓa genee Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1-3"/>
    <char style="w">
      <char style="tl">Farisen</char>
    </char> ca kerahha ne, ɓooɓa na woye ne taalubeeci Yeesu raak, na ɓi a na ɓokte, ɓeɗ uup ɓiŋ <char style="w">Yahya</char>. Nikka haa ne a Yeesu ŋ haf ce a yi na ɓoktohe haa, e taalubeeciŋ ɗe na ɓoktohe. Wa Yeesu inah ne <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca kerhiɗ woo keem, a kurkohha Yudee, a dokukka Galile.<verse eid="JHN 4:1-3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Ŋ kaɗaŋ ɗe, nikka ne a joy lahoh Samari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓi Samari na Yawuut ca kerhiɗoheeɗi ; ɓa heeftiɗohee heeftiɗoh, ɓa sangtiɗohha.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>A kaɗeeɗa po a reesa ŋ kur ɓaah ŋ Samari na woyse Sikaar ŋ sero yohna Yaŋhooɓa onee kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yuusufa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Ŋ ndaam, naacaŋ Yaŋhooɓa nikee nga. Wa Yeesu yaaɓ ŋ tiindiŋ ɗe, a ɓooffa ŋ sero naaca ; wa nikee ŋ leero noh.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7-8"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗta roma kañam ŋ ɗooƴ kur ka. Ɗekka po ɓitiɓ ɓaah ŋ ɓi Samari hayya neye. Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « On ndo ŋ an. »<verse eid="JHN 4:7-8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Ɓitɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Waaw ! Fu yi Yawuut, fu min ndo na kiimoh masuɓ, mi ɓitiɓ gen Samari ? » Waam raak Yawuut ci tiimbkee tiimbuk ɓi Samari.<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fu inheen ini Kooh onoh ɗah te fu inheen yi na kiimee ɗa masuɓ ɗah, a fu hee ɗe kiime masuɓ, a on ɗa masmi na onohe kipes. »<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Ɓitɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani naaci weɗi ye nooɗan, te fu raakɗi hoc, fu ɓayohan masmi na onohe kipes ŋ nde ? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>A fu uup caaciŋ ɓoo Yaŋhooɓa yi on ɓoo naacii e ? A aniɗ nga a yi na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, po ɗoopaat ciŋ ɗe sah. »<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Masmii, ɓo' nu an nga ɗah, a hey sifaɗkisse. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Waaye ɓo' nu an masmi mi na hee ɗe one ɗah, a moosanɗi sifaɗuk muk. Laam, wa na hee nikee culi na hee kaɗɗe ŋ ɗooƴ ce, wa on ɗe kipes ki heyɗi reehe. »<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Ɓitɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, on ndo ŋ masmeem, ne ŋ sifaɗkissuu, wa etohissuu ne ŋ hayee neye ŋ ndii. »<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Weɗ Yeesu woyoh ɗe ne : « Kaɗa fu ɓeeɗka ƴaar fu, fu hayis ndii. » <verse eid="JHN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Ɓitɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ raakɗi ƴaar. » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu woo keeh ŋ ini fu woo ne fu raakɗi ƴaar. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Fu raakeen ƴaar yatuus, te yi fu nik na ɗe woti-woti, a ƴaar fu haa. Fu woo keeh. »<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Ɓitɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ŋ hotiɗ nga ne fu woosuuɗ. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Ɓoo ɓi ɓi Samari, caac ciŋ ɓoo, meeɗ ñaamuk Kooh ŋ tangoorii, waaye ɗu ɓi Yawuut ci, ɗu woo ne ɗiska joy ñaamkohu wa ɗaa ŋ Yerusalem. »<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓitɓi, kosa ini mi na woyee ɗa wii, jamano wii hay, wa nikanɗi ne ɗu joy ñaamkoh Baabi ŋ tangoorii, wala ŋ Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Ɗu ɓi Samariici, ɗu na ñaamke Kooh waaye ɗu inahɗi ɗe ; te ɓoo ɓi Yawuut ci, Kooh yi ɓoo na ñaamke, ɓoo inhiɗ ɗe ; laam muci lahoh ŋ Yawuut ci. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Waaye jamano wa ɗii hay, te sah wa reyiɗ, ñaamkoh ci keeh-keeh ci, <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> hey ɓa one ɓa ñaamkee Baabi findi a nikoh keeh-keeh. Ñaamkoh mand ɗaa ɓeɗ Baabi waaɗ. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Kooh, a Fuuɗsiŋ kipes ki, weɗ tah ɓooɓi na ñaamkee ɗe joyiɗa tum taamboh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani na ɓayohe ŋ keeh ki. »<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Ɓitɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ ne <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> yi na woyse <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> hey haye. A hay ɗah, a hey ɓoo teeɓe in ci jen. »<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « E ñam, mi yi na woye na ɗa. »<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Teemb ndeem taalubeeciŋ ɗe reyeeɗa. Ɓa feyuusa ŋ ini ɓa hot Yeesu woyeeɗa na ɓitiɓ waaye ali ɓo' kaañɗi meeksoh ne : Fu waaɗ ye ? Wala fu na woye ye na ɓitɓii ?<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Ŋ ineem ɓitɓa faɗta neyohaanaŋ ɗe ŋ ndaam, a dokukka kur ka, a woosa ɓooɓa ne : <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>« Hayaat ɗu hot ! Ŋ cohiɗ na ɓoyi woo so in ci ŋ tum jen. Andi a Mucɗohi Gapohse ? » <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Weɗ ɓi kur ka puloh, ɓa hayeeɗa ŋ Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Bala ɓi kur ka reyan ɗah, taalubeeciŋ ɗe ñaakka nga ɗe woyeeɗa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ñama. » <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Waaye a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ raakiɗ kañam ñamaah, wi ɗu inahɗi. » <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Taalubeeci woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Andi a ɓo' kom ɗe kañam ? » <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Kañam kiŋ ngo, weɗ ne ŋ tum waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Yi woos so te ŋ ɗiindoh pangki a nak ko.<verse eid="JHN 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Ɓooɓa na woye ne : “ Ndii na caɓin nikiis weɗ nikan nguɗ. ” Waaye mi na woyee ɗu ne, jaɗtukaat ɗu marak yohon ci, ɗiski ca nik, ca ruundiɗ po ca suyiɗ, ca na seke nguɗu. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Nguɗohi yii rahas wirndiŋ ɗe, te a hey nangɗohe mbong ciŋ ɗe ; mbong ceem, ɓeɗ ɓi raakan kipes ki heyɗi reehe. Ŋ ineem sokohi na nguɗohi hey hune, ɓa sum. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Woyohaaɗii wa keeh ndii, an : “ Yii sok sok, yii nguɗta. ” <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Mi, ŋ tuuƴiɗ ɗu ne ɗu nguɗa ini ɗu guurɗi, ɓi ɓo' wiiriis ɓeɗ panguk, ɗu ɓii ñam opiŋ ɓa. »<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Ɓo' Samari laayiɗ gen kur keem, koseen Yeesu sagu woo ka ɓitɓa woyee ɓa ne : « A woyiɗ to in ci ŋ tum jen. » <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Weɗ tah po wa ɓi Samari hay ŋ Yeesu, ɓa kiimmba ɗe ne a nik na ɓa ; a nikka nga neeh kanak. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Ɓooɓa kosee ɗe uuppa nga laay sagu woo kaŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Ŋ ndeem, ɓa woyeeɗa ɓitɓa ne : « Wa nikisɗi ne a woo kiŋ ɗa tah ɓoo kossa ɗe waaye ɓoo kerhootiɗ ɗe, te ɓoo inhiɗ ne wa keeh ne a yi Mucɗohiŋ Adina. »<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ kuɓu dag buur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Wa Yeesu tum neeh kanak ŋ kur ka, a kurkohha ndaam, a kaɗta Galile. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Raak, a yi ŋ haf ce, a woyiɗ ne : « Woosuuɗ na eɗseeɗi cir ŋ kur ɓa. » <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Ɓi Galile, ɓa nameen kaɗ ŋ feetaŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> ŋ Yerusalem, weɗ tah, wa a ree nga, ɓa taambɗukka ɗe taambɗuk moɗoɗ, laam ɓa hoteen ina a haɓiɗ ŋ Yerusalem jen, ŋ feeta. <verse eid="JHN 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Yeesu dokukka Kanaa ngaŋ Galile, ɗiska a ɓoƴsohee masma biiñ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:46">Wa raakeen dag buur ŋ Kapernawum yi kuɓkiŋ ɗe ƴaari kosaaye. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Wa a kerah ne Yeesu kurkohiɗ Yudee hayiɗ Galile, a kaɗta ɗe raaka ne a kiim ɗe ne a hay, a wirɗiɗ ɗe kuɓkiŋ ɗe, raak yeem heeɗa kaane. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɗu hotɗi firnde wala keemaan ɗah, ɗu kosanɗi muk ! » <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Waaye daga loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, haya bala kuɓkiŋ ngo kaanan ɗah. » <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kaɗa, kuɓkaŋ ɗa wiriɗ, a yaa pes ! » Ƴaara kossa ina Yeesu woo, a kaɗta.<verse eid="JHN 4:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Wa a kaɗe, <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗe hayya cohe na ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kuɓkiŋ ɗa wiriɗ, a yaa pes ! » <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>A meekissa ɓa ne : « A ngisoh ŋ winde wahtu ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Wotɓa, ŋ njooloor, ŋ ineer (1h), weɗ dohɗiŋ faaniŋ ɗe cootoh. » <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Baabiŋ kuɓki inahha ne wa ŋ wahtuuni Yeesu woyoh ɗe ne : « Kuɓkiŋ ɗa wiriɗ, a yaa pes ! » Jaarra, a nikka ɓo' kosiɗ, a yi na ɓi kahan ce jen. <verse eid="JHN 4:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Wa nikka firndeeni Yeesu kanakɗoh tum ŋ pulohaŋ ɗe Yudee a kaɗta Galile.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ lafañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>A Yeesu nikoh ndaam po Yawuut ci raakka feet ŋ Yerusalem, a kaɗta nga. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Ŋ ɗooƴ Yerusalem, ŋ sero yahndeera na woyse Yahndeeraŋ-Mbaal-ca, raakeen mbalka yakiɗ ɓookkoha na woyse Betsata ŋ peɗeem Yawuut, ca perong yatuus ceɗ wilee wa. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Kosaayiɗ laayiɗ nikee faankiɗ ŋ perong ceem, na ɓi fuuliɗ na ɓi lafañ na ɓi ɓeendkiɗ. [<verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Ɓa meeɗ faanuk ndeem, ɓa sekee ne masma yoond. Laam raakiɗ malaaka Heɗ ɓoo yi na yooɓe ruhus nga, a yoondiɗ masmi. A yoondiɗtaa rek ɗah, kosaayiɗ nu koc aas nga ɗah, a wir, na kosaay nu a min raak ɗah." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Raakeen ƴaar nga, a kosaayiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na kiis yasna-kaahay (38). <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yeesu hotta ɗe faankiɗ, raak ɗe inhiɗ ne yeem maañiɗ ŋ ɗiska, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu waaɗiɗ wir e ? » <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Kosaayɗa loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ŋ raakɗi ali ɓo', yi ɓekan ndo ŋ mbalkaani ne masmi yoonnda ɗah. Ŋ kaɗeesa ɗah, raak yi koc co. » <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kurka, ɓaya basngiŋ ɗa, fu tiind ! » <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Jaarra ƴaara wirra ; a ɓayya basngaŋ ɗe, a tiindeeɗa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Wa hendee ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Tahha po kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca woyeeɗa ƴaara wirɗuuɗa ne : « Ɓoo ɓii ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, wa waas haa fu ɓayee basngiŋ ɗa ! » <verse eid="JHN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓoyi wiriɗ to, a yi woo so ne ŋ ɓayaat basngiŋ ngo, ŋ tiind ! » <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « A ya ɓa woo ɗa ne : “ Ɓaya basngiŋ ɗa, fu tiind ” ? » <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Waaye a inheeɗi ɓoyi wiriɗ ɗe, raak Yeesu kurkohiɗ ndaam, muuƴca ɗe ŋ mboolnda nikee ŋ ɗiska.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Wa degga ƴissuut, Yeesu cohha na ɗe ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a woosa ɗe ne : « Marka, fu wiriɗ kotii, kina bakaaɗis, bala ini uupa misik rahsan ɗa ɗah. » <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Ƴaara kaɗta woya kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca ne a Yeesu wiriɗ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Ineem weɗ tah po ɓa waaɗeeɗa tum Yeesu miskiɗ, sagu in ci a na tume ceem ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Baabiŋ ngo yii panguk po woti, mi yii nam panguk. » <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Ini a woo weem, tummba po kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca uuppa ɗe waaɗ ap. A topeeɗi ŋ taambɗaaɗi mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, waaye ɓaat nga a woo ne Kooh Baabiŋ ɗe, ŋ ineem a hendtiɗkohee haf ce na Kooh.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hatili Baabi on Kuɓki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Wa Yeesu kooɗis woo ka, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char>, ŋ haf ce, a minɗi haɓiɗ in ɗal ini a hot Baabi haɓɗee wa. In nu Baabi haɓiɗ ɗah, weɗ Kuɓki na haɓɗe. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Laam Baabi waaɗiɗ Kuɓki te in ci Baabi na haɓɗe jen, a na teeɓee ca teeɓ Kuɓki. A hey ɗe teeɓisse in ci uup yak cii, ne a nam ca tum, jaar ɗu feyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Maanaam findi Baabi na hultiɗohe kaaniɗ ci, a onee ɓa kipes, Kuɓki na name onoh kipes ɗaa ɓo' nu a waaɗa on ɗah. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Ɓaatta nga Baabi na atte'eeɗi ali ɓo', a degiɗ atteeni jen ŋ yaah Kuɓki, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>ne ɓooɓi jen yakiɗ Kuɓki findi ɓa na yakɗohe Baabi. Yaa nu yakiɗɗi Kuɓki ɗah, a yakiɗɗi Baabi woos ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, ɓo' nu kerah woo kiŋ ngo po a kos Yi woos so ɗah, a raakiɗ kipes ki heyɗi reehe. A ɓaahanɗi ŋ ɓi atte'san, a nikisɗi kaaniɗ, a aasiɗ ŋ kipes ki keeh-keehi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, jamano wii hay te wa reyiɗ, jamanooni kaaniɗ ci kerhohan hoosooriŋ Kuɓkiŋ Kooh ; te ɓi sikɗukana hey pese. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Laam findi kipes ki nikoh ŋ ɗooƴ Baabi, a namiɗ on Kuɓki ne kipes ki nikoh ŋ ɗooƴ ce ɗaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Te a oniɗ ɗe ne a min atte laam a yi <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dañeel 7:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Kinaat feyu ŋ in ceem, jamano wii hay, wi fu inah ne kaaniɗ ci jen ngaŋ ruy-ruy ciŋ ɓa hey kerhe hoosooriŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Ŋ ndeem ɓa hey pule ŋ ɗiski ɓa nik. Ɓi tumee in baahiɗ hey hulte ne ɓa pes po faw, ɓi tumee baahaaɗi hey hulte ne ɓa atte'u.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>Ŋ minɗi tum ali in ŋ njungiŋ ngo haf fo. Ŋ waakɗi ini neɓ po, waaye mi na waake ini neɓ Yi woos so, tahha po mi na atte'e findi Baabi nakoh ho te atteeniŋ ngo yurhiɗ. »<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seedeeni Yeesu seede'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Nik ne ñam na seede'e haf fo ɗah, seedeeniŋ ngo minɗi teyɗuku. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Waaye ŋ raakiɗ seede'oh wiiriis yi na seede'ee so, te ŋ inhiɗ ne seedeeniŋ ɗe keeh. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>E ɗu tuuƴee ɓi ɓo' ŋ <char style="w">Yahya</char>, te a seede'iɗ keeh ki. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Mi nak, ŋ etohɗi seede ɓo', waaye ŋ woyiɗ ineem ne ɗu min mucɗu. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yahya nikee laampaani na kaɓe, wi na siñaarɗe, te ɗu teyɗukiɗ neɓsiɗuk wahtu ƴissuut ŋ siñaariŋ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Waaye ŋ raak seedeeni uup yak wi Yahya seede'iɗ to, seedeeneem weɗ in ci Baabi eɗ to ne ŋ tum ca. Te tumohaaɗ ceem teeɓohiɗ ne a Baabi woos so. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Te Baabi woos so, a yi ŋ haf ce a namiɗ to seede. Ɗu moosɗi sikɗukoh hoosooriŋ ɗe, ɗu moosɗi markoh fikiiriŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Ɓaat nga woo kiŋ ɗe genɗi nga ɗu ; ini teeɓoha weɗ ne ɗu kosɗi Yi a woos.<verse eid="JHN 5:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Ɗu ɓii acsuk ŋ Fiis ci, sagu ini ɗu liiɓ ne ɗu miniɗ raak nga ca kipes ki heyɗi reehe ; te kat ca na seede'ee so. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Waaye ɗu waaɗɗi hay nga so ne ɗu raak kipes ki keeh-keehi !<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>Ŋ etohɗi ne ɓooɓi yakiɗ to. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Waaye ŋ inhiɗ ɗu : Ɗu waaɗɗi Kooh ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Mi, ŋ hayiɗ ŋ tiikiŋ Baabiŋ ngo, te ɗu teyɗukɗi so ; waaye ɓo' wiiriis hay ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe haf ce ɗah, ɗu hey ɗe teyɗuke ! <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Ɗu, ɗu etoh kiyak ki ɗu na eɗtiɗohe ŋ harmban ɗu, ɗu waakɗi kiyak ki puloh ŋ Koohi yino-kongi, weɗ tah ɗu minɗi so kos.<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Kinaat liiɓ ne a ñam na hee woye ŋ fiki Baabi ne ini ɗu tum baahɗi ; a <char style="w">Musaa</char> woyana, Musaa yi ɗu oolkoh. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Musaa woyiɗ nga so ŋ Fiis ci, tahha po ɗu koseen ɗe ɗah, ɗu heen ndo name kos. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Waaye, ɗu kosɗi Fiis ciŋ Musaa ɗah, ɗu kosanɗi woo ciŋ ngo. »<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓaataŋ mbuuruuca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Wa in ceem coot, wa raakka mbeh Yeesu kaɗta ɓaka winooraŋ Cookmaŋ-Galile, wi na name woyu Cookmiŋ-Tiberiyad. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Mboolo laayiɗ ñaakiɗta ɗe sagu firndeeca ɓa hotee ɗe haɓɗeeɗa, ŋ wirɗa a wirɗee kosaayiɗ ca. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yeesu rappa ŋ ɗafuk tango, ŋ ndaam, a ɓooffa nga na taalubeeciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Wa raak feetiŋ Yawuut ci na woyse <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> heeɗa ree.<verse eid="JHN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yeesu jaɗtukka, a hotta mboolo yakak hayeeɗa nga ɗe. A woosa Filip ne : « Mbuuruuci ɓooɓii ñaman, ɓoo romohan ca nde ? » <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>A markiskee Filip weɗ tah a woosa ineem ; a yi ŋ haf ce, a inheen ini a na hee tume. <verse eid="JHN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filip loffa ɗe ne : « Ali ɓoo ɓay <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char> teemet-kanak (200), ɓoo rom mbuuru, yaa nu nga ɗah, minanɗi raak sah nguɗ ƴin. »<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Taalube wiiriis na woyse Andare, taambɗoh Simong Piyeer, woosa Yeesu ne : « <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>Raakiɗ njaanji raak mbuuru <char style="tl">lorso</char> yatuus ndii na cuurund ƴin kanak. Waaye ca paƴɗi juukiŋ ɓooɓi in. »<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Woyaat mboolndi jen ne ɓa ɓoofaat. » Ndaam raakeen paangi laayiɗ. Ɓa ɓooffa nga, ƴaar ca nikeen ŋ ɓak junni-yatuus (5000). <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>A ɓayya mbuuruuca, a corkiɗta Kooh, a paysohha ca ɓooɓa ; a nammba tum cuurund ca ɗaa, po yaa nu nga ɗah raakka po doyiɗta.<verse eid="JHN 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Wa ɓa ñam po ɓa jen ɓa kappa, Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Nangɗohaat tasɗohiici, ali in kinaat yahuk nga. » <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Taalubeeca nangɗohha tasɗohiica po ɓa raakka pañe riifiɗ ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12). Ɓa kooɗohee ca ŋ tasɗohiicaŋ mbuuruuca yatuus ca ɓooɓa ñame.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Wa ɓooɓa hot firndeeni Yeesu haɓiɗ weem, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Wa keeh, a yi Woosuuɗi joyee hay Adina. » <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Waaye a inahha ne ɓa na hee ɗe ɓaye ŋ doole, ɓa tum ɗe buur ; a faɗta ɓa ndaam a cootissa ŋ ɗooƴ tangoora, kiik ce.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tiindiɗ ŋ ɗafuk cookma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Wa niina ree, taalubeeciŋ Yeesu ruhussa ŋ sereendaŋ cookma. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Ɓa aassa gaal ne ɓa kaɗ Kapernawum, ŋ ɓaka winooraŋ cookma. Wa ñuusa keen, raak Yeesu reeɗi nga ɓa paaɗ. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Wa puuɗseeɗa puuɗis raakiɗ doole, cookma jummba.<verse eid="JHN 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Wa ɓa joow ini ree <char style="tl">kilomeet</char> yatuus wala yasna-yino, ɓa ƴokka Yeesu tiindeeɗa ŋ ɗafuk cookma, a reɓeeɗa ŋ gaala. Ɓa tiitta. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Waaye a woosa ɓa ne : « A ñam, kinaat neƴƴoh ! » <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Ɓa waaɗta ɗe rapiɗ ŋ gaala rek, gaala reesa ɗiska ɓa kaɗe.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kañam ki puloh Eel ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Wa Kooh wiis, mboolnda tasee ŋ ɓaka faahaŋ cookma hotta ne gaal ƴin yino weɗ nikee nga, te Yeesu aaseeɗi nga na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, ɓa cootee kiik ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Wa ɓa nik ndaam, ɓa markeeɗa, ɓi gaal wiiriis puloh Tiberiyad, hayya ndaam, ŋ ɗiska Heɗi corkiɗohee Kooh ŋ mbuurnda, mboolnda ñammbaa.<verse eid="JHN 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Wa ɓooɓa hot ne Yeesu nikisɗi ndaam te taalubeeciŋ ɗe namɗi nik nga, ɓa aassa ŋ gaal caam, ɓa kaɗta ɗe waaka ŋ Kapernawum. <verse eid="JHN 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Ɓa ƴakaandukka cookma po ɓa reesa ŋ ndaam, ɓa raakka ɗe nga, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, fu ree ndii kiɗa ? » <verse eid="JHN 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh : Firndeeci ŋ teeɓoh tahɗi ɗu waakee so, waaye e mbuuruuci ɗu ñam po ɗu kappa. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Kinaat panguk ne ɗu raak kañam ki min yahuk, waaye pangkaat wuu kañam ki minɗi yahuk, wi na eɗohe kipes ki heyɗi reehe. Kañam keem, <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hey ɗu wa eɗe, a yi Kooh yi Baabi eɗ ne a nikiɗ ɗe. »<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo joy na tum po ɓoo haɓiɗ in ci Kooh nak ɓoo ? » <verse eid="JHN 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ini ɗu joy haɓiɗ, wi Kooh nak ɗu, weɗ ne ɗu kos Ɓoyi a woos. »<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Fu teeɓan ɓoo winde firnde ne ɓoo hota ɗah, ɓoo kos ini fu woo ? Fu haɓɗan ye ? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Caac ciŋ ɓoo ñamiɗ kañam ka ɓa teekee <char style="tl">maan</char> ŋ kehƴa hulanga, findi Fiis ci woyoha an : “ A eɗta ɓa kañam puloh Eel ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16">Pula 16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Sabuur 78:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:40">105:40</ref></char></note> ” » <verse eid="JHN 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh : A <char style="w">Musaa</char> eɗ ɗu kañam ka pulohee Eel ci haa, a Baabiŋ ngo na eɗee ɗu kañam ki keeh-keehi puloh Eel ci. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Laam, kañam ki Kooh eɗoh, weɗ kañam ki puloh Eel ci, te wa eɗee ɓi Adina kipes. »<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kon kilifaani, eɗa ɓoo kañam keem Kooh-nu-wiis. » <verse eid="JHN 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « A mi kañam ki na eɗohe kipes. Yaa nu hay nga so ɗah, a moosanɗi aɗuk te yaa nu kos so ɗah, a moosanɗi sifaɗuk. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Waaye ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa : Ɗu hotiɗ to, te wa tahɗi ɗu kos. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Ɓooɓi Baabi eɗ to jen hey haye nga so ; te ɓo' nu hay nga so ɗah, ŋ aañanɗi ɗe muk. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Ini tah ho ruhsoh Eel ci, wa nikɗi haa ne ŋ hay ne ŋ tum ini neɓ po, waaye ŋ hayiɗ ne ŋ tum waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Yi woos so. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Te waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Yi woos so weɗ ne ŋ joyɗi ñak ali ɓo' ŋ ɓi a eɗ to jen, waaye ŋ hultiɗ ɓa ŋ mbeha mirndohan. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ee, waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Baabiŋ ngo weɗ ne yaa nu hot <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> te a kos ɗe ɗah, a raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe ; te mi yi Kuɓki, ŋ hey ɗe hultiɗe ŋ mbeha mirndoh. »<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Yawuut ca ñaɗsukeeɗa ŋ Yeesu, ŋ ini a woyee ne a yi kañam ki ruhsoh Eel ci. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « A Yeesu kuɓkiŋ Suseef yii haa e ? Yi fu inah ne ɓoo inhiɗ yaay ɓa na baab ɓa ! A min na woyoh kotii ne a ruhsoh Eel ci ? » <verse eid="JHN 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Faɗaat ñaɗsuki ɗu na ñaɗsuke ŋ harmban ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Ali ɓo' minɗi hay nga so ne Baabi yi woos so nookɗi ɗe ɗah. Te mi, ŋ hey ɗe hultiɗe ŋ mbeha mirndoh. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Woosuuɗ ci fiisiɗ ne : “ Kooh hey ɓa jangɗe jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Esayi 54:13</ref></char></note> ” Ŋ ndeem, ɓo' nu sikɗuk Baabi, teyɗuk jangɗohiŋ ɗe ɗah, a hey haye nga so. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Nikɗi haa ne ɓo' moosiɗ hot Baabi ; e Yi puloh ŋ Kooh dong, a yi moos hot Baabi.<verse eid="JHN 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, ɓo' nu kos ɗah, a raakiɗ kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>A mi kañam ki na eɗohe kipes. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Caac ciŋ ɗu ñameen <char style="tl">maan</char> ŋ kehƴa hulanga ; hondohɗi ɓa kaaniɗ. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Waaye wii weɗ kañam ki ruhsoh Eel ci, ɓo' nu ñama ɗah, kaananɗi. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>A mi kañam ki na pese, a mi kañam ki ruhsoh Eel ci. Ɓo' nu ñam ŋ kañam kii ɗah, a hey pese po faw. Te kañam ki mi na hee eɗohe, e faaniŋ ngo. Ŋ hey wa eɗohe ne Adina pes. »<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Ŋ ineem, Yawuut ca taastiɗoheeɗa taastiɗoh miskiɗ ŋ harmban ɓa an : « Ƴaari eɗohan ɓoo faaniŋ ɗe na, ne ɓoo ñama ? » <verse eid="JHN 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, ɗu ñamɗi faaniŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi te ɗu anɗi ñif miŋ ɗe ɗah, ɗu raakanɗi kipes ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ɓo' nu ñam faaniŋ ngo, a an ñif miŋ ngo ɗah, a raakiɗ kipes ki heyɗi reehe, te mi, ŋ hey ɗe hultiɗe ŋ mbeha mirndoh. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Laam, faaniŋ ngo weɗ kañam keeh-keeh te ñif miŋ ngo weɗ anaah keeh-keeh. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ɓo' nu ñam faaniŋ ngo, a an ñif miŋ ngo ɗah, a genan ɓaah nga so, te mi, ŋ genan ɓaah nga ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Baabi woos so, a yi pes te mi na pesohee ɗe ; wa mand ɗaa, ɓo' nu ñam mbo ɗah, a pesohan ndo. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Kañam ki ruhsoh Eel ci weɗi wii. Wa mandɗi na wa caac caŋ ɗu ñame ; ɓa kaaniɗ, waaye ɓo' nu ñam kañam kii ɗah, a hey pese po faw. »<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Woo ceem ceɗ Yeesu woo, wa a jangɗohee ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>, ngaŋ Kapernawum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo ci na eɗohe kipes ki heyɗi reehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Wa taalubeeciŋ ɗe kerah woo ceem, laayiɗ nga ɓa woosa ne : « Woo cii neɓɗi kerhu, ya ɓa min ca sikɗuk ? » <verse eid="JHN 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Yeesu inheen ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne taalubeeci ɓii ñaɗsuk ŋ ineem, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ini ŋ woo yoondiɗ ɗu yoondiɗ e ? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Moo ɗu hot Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi rapee ŋ ɗiska a kocee nik ɗah nak ? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>A <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> na eɗohe kipes, ɓo' na faan ce a minɗi haɓiɗ ali in. Woo ci ŋ woo ɗu ceem puloh ŋ Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh te ca na eɗohe kipes. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Waaye raakiɗ nga ɗu ɓooɓi kosɗi. » Ŋ ineem Yeesu inheen ŋ cambohaana ɓi kosɗi ɗe, na yi na hee ɗe eɗndohe. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>A degga nga ne : « Weɗ tah ŋ woyiɗ ɗu ne : Ali ɓo' minɗi hay nga so ne Baabi onɗi ɗe ne a hay nga so ɗah. »<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Ina amboh waam, laayiɗ ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe faɗta ɗe, ɓa hunisɗi na ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Yeesu woosa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) ne : « Ɗu, ɗu namɗi waaɗ kaɗ e ? » <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simong Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, ɓoo na hee kee ŋ ɓa ? Yaf ɓayoh woo ci na eɗohe kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Ɓoo kosiɗ te ɓoo inhiɗ ne yaf Hooliɗi puloh ŋ Kooh. »<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam kooɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) haa e ? Moona yino nga ɗu, a Seytaani. » <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>A woyee Yudaa, kuɓkiŋ Simong Iskaryot, yi eɗndohan ɗe. Yeem ɓaahee ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12).<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Taambɗoh ciŋ Yeesu kosɗi ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Ŋ finho woo ceem, Yeesu taalndiɗta, wileeɗa Galile, a kaɗeeɗa kur na kur. Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca nikee waaɗeeɗa ɗe ap, tahha po a waaɗeeɗi wil ŋ ɗooƴ Yudee. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Waam raak feetiŋ Yawuut ci, wi ɓa na nikohe ŋ ɗiip ci,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-36">Lewiici 23:33-36</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">39-43</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-15">Rohƴiɗi 16:13-15</ref></char></note> heeɗa ree. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Taambɗoh ciŋ Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu joyiɗ kuruk ndii, fu kaɗ Yudee ne taalubeeciŋ ɗa nam hot in ci fu na tume. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Ɓo' waaɗta inhu ɗah, a na ɗasɗukeeɗi. Kaɗ po fu tumee in hend an yak ɗah, teeɓoha haf fu ŋ adinaani jen. » <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Raak taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ŋ haf ɓa sah, koseeɗi ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Wahtuuniŋ ngo reeɗi paaɗ. Waaye nga ɗu wahtu nu nik baahiɗ. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Adina minɗi ɗu sang ; waaye mi nak, ɓa sangiɗ to sagu ne mi na seede ne tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa baahɗi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Ɗu, kaɗaat feeta ; mi, wahtuuniŋ ngo reeɗi paaɗ. Ŋ kaɗɗi. » <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Wa a ƴut ɓa woo ineem, a tassa ŋ Galile.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ feetaŋ ɗiip ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Wa taambɗoh ciŋ Yeesu kaɗ feeta, a nammba kaɗ, waaye a teeɓohukɗi ŋ ɓooɓa, a ɗembee ɗemb. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Ŋ feeta, kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca waakeeɗa ɗe, ɓa meeksoheeɗa an : « A nde ƴaari ? » <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Woo laayiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗe raakka ŋ ɗooƴ mboolnda. Ɓii woyeeɗa ne : « A ɓo' baahiɗ, » ɓum lofeeɗa ne : « Muk, a na muuƴɗe ɓooɓi. » <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Waaye ali ɓo' kaañeeɗi woo ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗe po fu kerhu, sagu neƴƴoh kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Wa feeta kaɗ po ŋ mbehi nik ŋ leerniŋ wa, Yeesu kaɗta <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a jangɗoheeɗa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca feyuusa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ƴaarii a jangɗi, a tumoh na po a inahha Fiis ci hooliɗ ci mand an ? » <verse eid="JHN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Jangɗohiŋ ngo pulohɗi nga so, waaye ŋ Yi woos so. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Ɓo' nu tufuk ne a tum ini Kooh waaɗ ɗah, a hey inhe andi ini mi na jangɗohe puloh nga ɗe wala nga so. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Ɓoyi na woye woo ki puloh nga ɗe na yakɗe haf ce, a yi ŋ haf ce. Waaye ɓoyi na waake yaki yi woos ɗe yak, a ɓo'-keeh, lee nikɗi nga ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>
    <char style="w">Musaa</char> eɗiɗ ɗu waasi, te moona ali ɓo' nga ɗu tumɗi ini wa nakoh. Wa ye tah ɗu waaɗta so ap ? » <verse eid="JHN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Mboolnda loffa ɗe ne : « Fu yii, a <char style="w">jiini</char> na ɗa ! A ya ɓa waaɗ ɗa ap ? » <verse eid="JHN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>A lofissa ɓa ne : « Ŋ haɓiɗ in yino dong, ɗu jen ɗu feyuuɗ !<verse eid="JHN 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Markaat rek : Musaa nakiɗ ɗu ne ɗu nguɗee kuɓuuciŋ ɗu ŋ neeha yasna-kaahayɗoh,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lewiici 12:3</ref></char></note> weɗ tah ɗu na nguɗe nguɗ sah komaaki ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>. Te moona <char style="w">nguɗuk</char> pulohɗi nga ɗe, wa puloh ŋ caac ca.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Camba 17:10-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Nik ne ɓo' na nguɗke ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse sagu ne <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> nikuu taambɗassaaɗi ɗah, wa ye tah ɗu ayrukee so ŋ ini ŋ ɓay ɓo', ŋ wiriɗta cir ciŋ ɗe jen ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse ? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Faɗaat atte ŋ ini ɗu na hote dong, atte'aat keeh. »<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu a yi Mucɗohi Gapohse e ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Wa ɓi ɓo' gen Yerusalem hot Yeesu, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « A ƴaari ɓa na waaɗe ap yii haa e ? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Marka ! A yii na jombe halang ŋ fiki ɓooɓi te ali ɓo' wooɗi ɗe in ! Kilifaaci inah inah ne a yi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> hanaa ? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Moona ƴaarii ɓoo inhiɗ ɗiski a puloh te Mucɗohi Gapohse hay ɗah, ali ɓo' inhanɗi ɗiski a pulohan ! »<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Waam raak Yeesu jangɗoheeɗa ŋ Kahan Kooh, a woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « An ɗu inhiɗ to i ? Ɗu inhiɗ ɗiski ŋ puloh i ? Moona ŋ hayɗi ŋ njungiŋ ngo haf fo ; Yi woos so, a oolkaah, te ɗu inahɗi ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Mi, ŋ inhiɗ ɗe, laam ŋ puloh nga ɗe te a yi woos so. »<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Wa a ƴut ɓa woo woo keem, ɓa waaɗta ɗe amb, waaye ali ɓo' minɗi ɗe deg yaah sagu ne wahtuuniŋ ɗe reyeeɗi paaɗ. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ mboolnda koseen ɗe, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Mucɗohi Gapohse hay ɗah, a hey haɓɗe firndeeci uup laay ci ƴaarii haɓiɗ e ? »<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi alkaate woosuuɗ ne ɓa amb Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Wa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca yeg ina mboolnda woyee ŋ kehƴi ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, ɓa na kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca, woossa ɓi ɓo' ne ɓa amb ɗe. Ɓooɓeem ɓaah ŋ alkaateeca niiɗee kahan Kooh. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Mi yii ndii na ɗu waaye wa maañanɗi, ƴut ɗah ŋ hey dokke ŋ Yi woos so. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Ɗu hey yo waake, waaye ɗu hotanɗi so ; ɗiski ŋ nikan, ɗu minɗi kaɗ nga. » <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Yawuut ca woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « A na kaɗe nde po ɓoo minɗi ɗe raak nga ? A na kaɗe ŋ Yawuut ca pasarkoh ŋ ɓa nikɗi Yawuut e ? Wala a na kee jangɗa ɓa nikɗi Yawuut ? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Woo ki a woo tokis ye ? An “ Ɗu hey yo waake, waaye ɗu hotanɗi so ; ɗiski ŋ nikan, ɗu minɗi kaɗ nga. ” »<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masmi na eɗohe kipes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Mbeha mirndoh ŋ feeta, weɗ uup yak nga. Mbaɗi, Yeesu kurukka, a woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Ɓo' nu sifaɗuk ɗah, a hayaat nga so a an. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Yaa nu kos so ɗah, ɓi cul masuɓ hey nupɗe puloh ŋ keeñiŋ ɗe, cul ciŋ masmi na eɗohe kipes,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:11">Esayi 58:11</ref></char></note> findi Fiis ci woyoha. » <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Ŋ woo keem, a woyee <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ɓooɓi kosan ɗe rahsan. Jamanoonaam raak Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani hayɗi ndoom sagu ne yaki Yeesu yak teeɓohuuɗi paaɗ.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mboolnda ɓaahɗi hotohaaɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Ɓi ɓo' ŋ mboolnda, wa ɓa kerah woo ciŋ Yeesu ceem, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Wa keeh ƴaarii a yi Woosuuɗi sekse ! » <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Ɓinooɓa woyeeɗa ne : « A yi Mucɗohi Gapohse ! » Waaye raakka ɓi woyee ne : « Mucɗohi Gapohse miniɗ puloh Galile e ? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Fiis ci wooɗi wooɗi ne Mucɗohi Gapohse na hee pulohe ŋ set ciŋ Dawuuda<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2 Samuwel 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:4-5">Sabuur 89:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Esayi 9:6</ref> </char></note> e ? Ca namɗi namɗi woo ne a rimkohan Betlehem<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Miise 5:1</ref> </char></note> ŋ kur ɓi Dawuuda e ? » <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Ɗaa, raakka ɓi hun na ɗe ŋ mboolnda, raakka ɓi hunɗi na ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Raakka ɓi waaɗee ɗe amb, waaye ali ɓo' degɗi ɗe yaah.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca kosɗi Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Wa alkaateeca woossee dokuk ŋ kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca, ɓeem meekissa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu haytohɗi ɗe ? » <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Ɓa loffa ne : « Ali ɓo' moosɗi woyoh findi ƴaareem ! » <verse eid="JHN 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/><char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca woosa ɓa ne : « An na, ɗu nam nam muuƴɗu e ? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Ɗu hotiɗ yino ŋ kilifaaci wala <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci kosiɗ ɗe e ? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>E ɓooɓi inahɗi waasiŋ Musaa, ɓeɗ dong kos ɗe. Ɓa alku alku ! »<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nikodem yi ɓaah ŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca te a kaɗohiɗ marka Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>« Mand ndo waasiŋ ɓoo onohɗi ne ɓoo atte ɓoyi ɓoo sikɗukɗi, yi ɓoo inahɗi ini a haɓiɗ. » <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Fu nam gen Galile e ? Marka baahiɗ, fu hey hote ne ali woosuuɗ pulohɗi Galile. » [<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Ƴutta yaa nu nga ɗa, haadda kahan ce.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓitɓa njaalo'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Wa ɓooɓa haad, Yeesu kaɗta Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Waaye wa Kooh wiis na ɓaaɓa teel, a dokukka <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>. Ɓooɓa jen hayya nga ɗe. A ɓooffa, a jangɗeeɗa ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Weɗi jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca komoh ɗe ɓitiɓ, a telu telu njaalo'eeɗa. Ɓa tufkiɗta ɓitɓa ŋ fiki mboolnda. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Ɓa woosa Yeesu ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓitɓii telu telu njaalo'eeɗa. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Te ŋ waasiŋ ɓoo, Musaa woo ne ɓitiɓ ci mand an tapsaat atoh po ɓa kaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wa mand haa ne, ndii ɓa na waaɗe woo ini fiisu ŋ teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Rohƴiɗi 22:22-24</ref></char>, waaye ini fiisu ndeem, e ƴaari na ɓitɓi jen tapsan atoh po ɓa kaan.</note>. Kon nak, fu, fu woo ye nga ? » <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Ɓa woyee ineem ne ɓa woyɗukoh ɗe woo uupiɗ, ɓa min raak yambaah ɗe. Waaye a hiirra, a fiiseeɗa na ndukniŋ ɗe ŋ kehƴi.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Ɓa taalndiɗta, ɓa meekseeɗa, ɓa meeksisseeɗa ɗe, a jaɗtukka, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoyi moosɗi bakaaɗoh nga ɗu kocaat ɗe njaf atoh. » <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>A hiirissa a fiisisseeɗa ŋ kehƴi.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Wa ɓooɓa ɓayee ɓitɓa kerah woo keem, ɓa cooteeɗa yino yino, cambohha ŋ yakak ca. Yeesu tassa nga kiik ce na ɓitɓa, ŋ fiki mboolnda. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Ŋ ndeem, Yeesu jaɗtukka, woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓitɓi, ɓa nde ? Ali ɓo' eɗɗi ɗa tooñ e ? » <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Ɓitɓa loffa ne : « Ali ɓo', kilifaani. » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ namanɗi ɗa eɗ tooñ ; fu miniɗ kaɗ waaye ini amboh woti, kina bakaaɗis. »]<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siñaariŋ Adina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Yeesu woyissa ɓooɓa ne : « A mi siñaariŋ Adina ; yaa nu ñaakiɗ to ɗah, a hey raake siñaariŋ kipes ki, a tiindanɗi muk ŋ ñuusi. » <verse eid="JHN 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Ŋ ineem <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca woosa ɗe ne : « A fu na seede'e haf fu, in ci fu na woye minɗi teyɗuku. »<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ali nik ne ñam na seede'e haf fo, mi, ŋ inhiɗ ɗiski ŋ puloh na ɗiski mi na kaɗe, weɗ tah po seedeeniŋ ngo keeh. Waaye ɗu, ɗu inahɗi ɗiski ŋ puloh na ɗiski mi na kaɗe. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Ɗu na atte'e findi ɓo' na atte'ohe, mi nak ŋ atteeɗi ali ɓo'. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Te kaɗ po ŋ atte'ee ɗah, ŋ atte'an kiik ko haa, Baabi woos so yii na so, weɗ tah po ŋ atte'an keeh. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Ŋ waasiŋ ɗu, wa fiisuuɗ ne ɓo' kanak hun ŋ seede in ɗah, seedeeniŋ ɓa miniɗ teyɗuku.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Rohƴiɗi 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Mi, maa seede'e haf fo te Baabi woos so yii nam mbo seede'iɗ. »<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « A nde baab ɗu ? » A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inahɗi so, ɗu inahɗi Baabiŋ ngo. Ɗu inheen ndo ɗah, ɗu heen name inah Baabiŋ ngo. » <verse eid="JHN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>A woyee woo ceem wa a jangɗohee ŋ ɗooƴ Kahan Kooh. A nikee ŋ sero ɗiska na degohse kopor ca, te ali ɓo' ambɗi ɗe laam wahtuuniŋ ɗe reyeeɗi paaɗ.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu, a Baabi woos ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yeesu woyissa ɓa ne : « Mi yii kaɗ, ɗu hey yo waake, te ɗu kaanan na bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu ; ɗiski mi na kaɗe, ɗu minɗi kaɗ nga. » <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Yawuut ca woosa ne : « Hanaa kay a heyɗi ape haf ce po a woyee ne : “ Ɗiski mi na kaɗe, ɗu minɗi kaɗ nga ” ? »<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu puloh ŋ kehƴi, mi, ŋ puloh ŋ ɗafki. Ɗu puloh ŋ adinaanii, te mi ŋ puloh ŋ adinaanii haa. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Weɗ tah ŋ woosa ɗu ne ɗu na hee kaane na bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu. Ɗu kosɗi ne ñam nik ɗah, ɗu kaanan na bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗu. » <verse eid="JHN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « A fu ɓa, fu ? »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">A loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa ŋ cambohaana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa ŋ cambohaana" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "Wa ye tah ŋ woyee na ɗu sah ?"</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Ŋ raakiɗ woyaah na atte'aah laayiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗu ; waaye mi na woye ɓi Adina ini ŋ kerah ŋ Yi woos so, te a woyoh keeh. » <verse eid="JHN 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Ɓa inheeɗi ne a na woyee ɓa Baabi.<verse eid="JHN 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Ŋ ndeem Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗ po ɗu meeɓ <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> ɗah, ɗu hey inhe ne, ñam nik te ɗu hey name inah ne mi na haɓɗooteeɗi ali in, waaye mi na woye ini Baabi jangiɗ to dong. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Yi woos so yii na so, mi na gene haɓiɗ ini neɓ ɗe, weɗ tah a faɗɗi so kiik ko. » <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Wi ɓa kerah ɗe woyoheeɗa ɗaa, laayiɗ kossa ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">E Kuɓkiŋ Kooh na one ɓo' raak haf ce</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yeesu woosa Yawuut ca kosee ɗe ne : « Ɗu gen amb woo kiŋ ngo ɗah, ɗu nikan taalubeeciŋ ngo keeh-keeh ; <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>ɗu hey inhe keeh ki ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kooh, te keeh keem hey ɗu one ɗu raak haf ɗu. » <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo ɓaah ŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima te ɓoo moosɗi nikoh <char style="w">ñaam</char> ɓo' ; fu min na woyoh ne : “ Ɗu hey raake haf ɗu ” ? » <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh : Yaa nu haɓiɗ bakaaɗ ɗah, a ñaamiŋ bakaaɗ. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Te ñaam na geneeɗi ɓaah ŋ kahni a nikoh ; kuɓu nak a genan gen ɓaah ŋ kahni. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Nik ne a <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> on ɗu, ɗu raakka haf ɗu ɗah, ɗu hey raake haf ciŋ ɗu keeh-keeh.<verse eid="JHN 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu ɓaah ŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima ; waaye ɗu teyɗukɗi woo kiŋ ngo ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu, weɗ tah ɗu na waakee so ne ɗu ap po. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Mi, mi na woye ini ŋ hot ŋ Baabi ; waaye ɗu, ɗu na tume ini ɗu kerhoh ŋ baabiŋ ɗu. » <verse eid="JHN 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Baabiŋ ɓoo, a Ibrahiima. » A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu nikee kuɓu Ibrahiima keeh-keeh ɗah, ɗu heen taambe ŋ kot ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Waaye ɗiski wa nik, ɗu na waakee so ne ɗu ap po, mi yi na woyee ɗu keeh ki ŋ kerhoh ŋ Kooh. Ibrahiima moosɗi liiɓoh tum in mand ɗaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Ɗu na taambe ŋ kot ciŋ baabiŋ ɗu. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo kuɓu njaaloo haa ; ɓoo raak Baab yino dong, Kooh. » <verse eid="JHN 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Kooh nikee Baabiŋ ɗu ɗah, ɗu heen ndo waaɗe ; laam mi, ŋ puloh ŋ Kooh, ŋ hayiɗ saguuce ; ŋ hayɗi ŋ njungiŋ ngo haf fo, waaye a yi woos so. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Wa ye tah ɗu minɗi inah ini mi na woyee ɗu ? Ɗu minɗi minɗi teyɗuk ini mi na jangɗohe weɗ tah.<verse eid="JHN 8:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Ɗu, e Seytaani baabiŋ ɗu, te ɗu waaɗ tum ini neɓ baabiŋ ɗu. A moos nik apoh ɓo' ŋ camba poyi ; a na nikeeɗi ŋ keeh, laam keeh nikɗi nga ɗe. A leyee ɗah, a na woye ini a nikoh, laam a leyoh te a yi fer lee. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Te mi, mi na woye keeh, weɗ tah ɗu kosɗi ini ŋ woo. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>A ya ɓa min seede nga ɗu ne ŋ bakaaɗohiɗ ? Ŋ woo keeh ɗah, wee tah ɗu kosɗi so ? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Yaa nu nik wuu Kooh ɗah, na teyɗuke teyɗuk woo ciŋ Kooh. Mbaa, ɗu nikɗi wuu Kooh, weɗ tah ɗu teyɗukɗi woo ciŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Ibrahiima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca loffa Yeesu ne : « Ini ɓoo woo wa keeh : Fu ɓo' Samari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓi Samari na Yawuut ca kerhiɗoheeɗi ; ɓa heeftiɗohee heeftiɗoh, ɓa sangtiɗohha.</char></note>, a <char style="w">jiini</char> na ɗa ! » <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Jiini nikɗi na so. Mi na yakɗe Baabiŋ ngo te ɗu, ɗu na woye in moɗaaɗi nga so. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Mi, ŋ jeemɗi yakiɗ haf fo ; raakiɗ Yi waaɗ ne ŋ yakɗu, te a yi na atte'e.<verse eid="JHN 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh : Yaa nu amb woo kiŋ ngo ɗah, a heyɗi kaane, a hey pese po faw. » <verse eid="JHN 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo inhiɗ kotii ne a jiini na ɗa. Ibrahiima kaaniɗ, woosuuɗ ci namiɗ kaan, fu, fu woyee ne yaa nu amb woo kiŋ ɗa ɗah, a heyɗi kaane ! <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>A fu uup Ibrahiima, baabiŋ ɓoo e ? A kaaniɗ, woosuuɗ ci namiɗ kaan. Fu teek haf fu ɓa ? »<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Nik ne ñam na yakɗe haf fo ɗah, yaki ŋ yak wa in haa. A Baabiŋ ngo a yi na yakɗee so, a yi ɗu na woye ne a Koohiŋ ɗu ! <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Te ɗu inahɗi ɗe, waaye mi, ŋ inhiɗ ɗe. Ŋ woyeen ne ŋ inahɗi ɗe ɗah, ŋ hee nike leyoh findiiɗu. Waaye ŋ inhiɗ ɗe te ŋ ambiɗ woo kiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 8:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Baabiŋ ɗu Ibrahiima neɓsiɗkiɗ ŋ waaɗi a waaɗee hot hayiŋ ngo, a hotiɗa te a summba. » <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Fu raakɗi kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus paaɗ, an fu hotiɗ Ibrahiima i ? » <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, bala Ibrahiima nikan ɗah, raak e ñam nik. » <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa parahha atoh ne ɓa tap ɗe, waaye a ɗemmba, a pulla Kahan Kooh.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ƴaar rimkiɗ fuuliɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yeesu kaɗeeɗa, a hotta ƴaar fuuliɗ, yi rimu naa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe meekissa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, wa ye tah ƴaarii rimuusa fuuliɗ, a yi bakaaɗ wala e ɓooɓi rim ɗe ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « A yi haa, e ɓooɓi rim ɗe haa, waaye fuuli a fuul tahiɗ po Kooh hey teeɓohe tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe nga ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Feeh ɓoo ɓii ŋ noh ɗah, ɓoo joy joy tum tumohaaɗ ciŋ Yi woos so ; weki wii hay, wi fu inah ne ali ɓo' minanɗi tum in. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Feeh mi yii ŋ adinaani ɗah, ñam siñaariŋ wa. »<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Wa a woo ineem, a tuhussa ŋ kehƴi, a iiri'iɗta merhey na mituhus miŋ ɗe, a reeffaa ŋ has caŋ fuulɗa. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>A woosa ɗe ne : « Kaɗa fu muktuka ŋ mbalkaanaŋ Silowe. » (Silowe tokis tuuƴu). Ƴaara kaɗta, a muktukka, wi a hay, a hoteeɗa moɗoɗ.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Gentoh caŋ ɗe, na ɓooɓa meeɗ ɗe hot yalwaane woyeeɗa an : « A ƴaarii meeɗ ɓoof ndii yalwaane haa e ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Ɓum woyeeɗa ne : « A yi. » Ɓinooɓi woyeeɗa ne : « A yi haa, ɓa mand mand. » Waaye ƴaara ŋ haf ce woosa ne : « A ñam sah de' ! » <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Ɓa woyeeɗa ɗe ne : « Tumoh na po fu hotee kotii ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>A loffa ne : « A ƴaari na woyse Yeesu a yi iiri'iɗ merhey, a reeffaa ŋ has ciŋ ngo, a woosa so ne ŋ kaɗaat ŋ muktuka ŋ Silowe ; ŋ kaɗta ŋ muktukka nga, jaarra ŋ minnda hot. » <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « A nde ƴaareem ? » A loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ inahɗi ɗiski a nik. »<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca na fuulɗa wirɗasse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Weɗi ɓa ɓayoh ƴaara fuulee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Raak, mbeha Yeesu iiri'ɗee merhey ma, a wiriɗta has ciŋ ƴaara, wa nikee <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/><char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca nammba meekis ƴaara findi wa kaɗoh po a hote. Ƴaara woosa ɓa ne : « A tum merhey iiri ŋ has ciŋ ngo, ŋ muktukka, ŋ hotta. »<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Ŋ ineem raakka <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca woyee ne : « Yeesu yeem minɗi puloh ŋ Kooh, a na taambɗeeɗi in ci nakohu ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse. » Ɓum woyeeɗa ne : « Bakaaɗoh min na teeɓohoh firnde feyohiɗ findi cii ? » Paysukoh raakka ŋ harmban ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa woyissa ƴaara ne : « Fu woo ye ŋ ƴaari hotiɗ has ciŋ ɗa ? » Ƴaara loffa ne : « A woosuuɗ. »<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca koseeɗi ne a fuulee fuul, a wirɗuusa, tahha po ɓa ɓeeɗukka yaay ɓa na baab ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Ɓa meekissa ɓa ne : « An yii kuɓkiŋ ɗu i ? Wa keeh ne a rimu fuuliɗ e ? Tumoh na po a hotee kotii ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Ɓeem loffa ne : « Ɓoo inhiɗ daal ne yii, a kuɓkiŋ ɓoo te a rimu fuuliɗ ; <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>waaye findi wa kaɗoh po a hotee kotii, ɓoo inahɗaa, te ɓoyi tah a minnda hot, ɓoo namɗi ɗe inah. Meeksaat ɗe, a komaaki haa, a miniɗ woyiɗ haf ce. »<verse eid="JHN 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Ɓa neƴƴohee kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca, weɗ tah po ɓa woosa ineem. Raak ɓeem huniɗ ne ɓo' nu teyɗuk ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ne a Yeesu a yi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> ɗah, a hey aañse ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Ineem weɗ tah yaay ɓa na baab ɓa woosa ne : « A komaaki haa, meeksaat ɗe. »<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Weɗ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca ɓeeɗkohis ƴaara fuule waasi kanakɗoh, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Woyɗa Kooh, ɓoo inhiɗ ne ƴaareem bakaaɗoh. » <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>A loffa ne : « Ŋ inahɗi andi a bakaaɗoh wala, waaye in yino ŋ inhiɗa, weɗ ne ŋ fuuleen, mi yii hot. » <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Ɓa meekissa ƴaara ne : « A haɓiɗ ye ŋ has ciŋ ɗa ? A tumoh na po fu hotta ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Ƴaara loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa po ƴutiɗ, waaye ɗu sikɗukɗi so. Wa ye tah ɗu waaɗissaa kerah ? Mand haa ne ɗu nam waaɗ nik taalubeeciŋ ɗe ! »<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Ɓa ɓassa ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « A fu taalubeeniŋ ƴaareem ! Ɓoo kay, ɓoo taalubeeciŋ <char style="w">Musaa</char>. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Ɓoo inhiɗ ne Kooh woyiɗ na Musaa, waaye ƴaarii, ɓoo inahɗi ɗiski a puloh. » <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ineem nak weɗ feyoh, ɗu inahɗi ɗiski a puloh te a wirɗiɗ has ciŋ ngo ! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Ɓoo inhiɗ ne Kooh na teyɗukɗeeɗi bakaaɗoh ci, waaye ɓoyi kerhiɗ Kooh te a haɓɗee ini a waaɗ, ɓoyeem a yi a na teyɗukɗe. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Ina Adina nikoh poyi, wa kerhohuuɗi ne ɓo' hotɗiɗ fuuliɗ rimuuɗ fuuliɗ. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Ƴaareem puloheeɗi ŋ Kooh ɗah, a heeɗi mine haɓiɗ ali in. » <verse eid="JHN 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Fu yi rimuk findi fu hend jen ŋ bakaaɗ, a fu na jangɗe ɓoo e ? » Weɗi ɓa pulɗoh ɗe ŋ hara.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fuuliɗ ci keeh-keeh ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Wa Yeesu kerah ne ƴaara pulɗuuɗ, a kaɗta ɗe marka, a woosa ɗe ne : « Fu kosiɗ <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> e ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Ƴaara woosa ne : « A ya ɓa po ŋ min ɗe kos kilifaani ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu hotiɗ ɗe, a mi yi na woye na ɗa yii. » <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Jaarra ƴaara woosa ne : « Heɗi, ŋ kosiɗ. » Ŋ ineem a ƴekka ŋ fiki Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Ƴutta Yeesu woosa ne : « Ŋ hayiɗ Adina ne Adina atte'u, ŋ hay ne fuuliɗ ci hot te ɓi na hote fuul. » <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Raakka <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca nikee na ɗe ; wa ɓa kerah woo keem, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo nam nik fuuliɗ e ? » <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu nikee fuuliɗ ɗah, ɗu heeɗi raake bakaaɗ, waaye ɗu woo ne ɗu ɓii hot, weɗ tah ɗu genan ŋ bakaaɗ. »<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Niiɗohi baahiɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh : yaa nu aas ŋ gatiŋ mbaal ci, te a lahohɗi yahndeeri waaye a lahoh ɗisik wiiriis ɗah, a rokoh, a rokoh ganaaykiɗ. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Waaye yi na aase, a lahoh ŋ yahndeeri, yeem a yi niiɗohiŋ mbaal ci. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Yi na neehe ŋ gati hey ɗe rangsiɗe buntaani, mbaal ci kerah hoosooriŋ ɗe. A ɓeeɗuk mbaal ci a raak yaa nu nga ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe, a puliɗ ca ŋ hara. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>A puliɗ ca jen ɗah, a adug, ca ñaakee nga ɗe, laam ca inhisiɗ hoosooriŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Ca ñaakɗanɗi ɓoyi ca inahɗi muk, ca nupan ɗe nup, sagu ini ca inahɗi hoosooriŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yeesu woyohee na ɓooɓa nikee ndaam ɗaa, waaye ɓa inahɗi ini a waaɗee woo nga. <verse eid="JHN 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>A woyissa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh : A mi yahndeeriŋ mbaal ci. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Ɓi adug ko hay jen, ɓa rokoh na rokoh ganaaykiɗ, waaye mbaal ci sikɗukɗi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>A mi yahndeeri, ɓo' nu lahoh nga so aas ɗah, a hey mucɗasse, a hey kaɗe, a haye, te a raak ñamaah. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Rokohi, a rok na hoos na yahroh dong na tahee ɗe kuruk ; waaye mi, ŋ hayiɗ ne mbaal ci raak kipes, te wa nikan kipes mitiɗ sik.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>A mi niiɗohi baahiɗi. Niiɗoh baahiɗ, mbaal ciŋ ɗe na carɗee ɗe cariɗ kiñin kiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Waaye yi nikɗi niiɗoh keeh-keeh, te a nikɗi heɗ mbaal ci, a na pangke sagu kopor dong. A hot ngumu haye ɗah, a na faɗe faɗ mbaal ci, a saandoh na mbup. Ngumfi aas gati, raak ci a ɓay, gati pasarsukoh. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Ƴaareem hey saandohe. E kopor na tahee ɗe niiɗ, mbaal ci bugulɗi ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>A mi niiɗohi baahiɗi. Ŋ inhiɗ mbaal ciŋ ngo, te mbaal ciŋ ngo inhiɗ to, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>findi mi na Baabi inhohoh. Te ŋ hey eɗohe kiñin kiŋ ngo sagu mbaal ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Ŋ raakissiɗ mbaal wiiriis ci ɓaahɗi ŋ gatii, ŋ joyiɗ ca nam ɓay. Ca hey sikɗuke woo kiŋ ngo ; wa nikan gat yino na niiɗoh yino.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Ini tah Baabi waaɗ to weɗ ne, ŋ hey eɗohe kiñin kiŋ ngo ne ŋ ɓayisa. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Ali ɓo' ɓayanɗi kiñin kiŋ ngo, e ñam na hee wa eɗohe ŋ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ngo. Ŋ onuuɗ ne ŋ eɗoha te ŋ namiɗ onu ne ŋ ɓayisa ; ineem weɗ Baabiŋ ngo nak ko tum. »<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Woo ceem ɓayissa paysukoh ŋ Yawuut ca. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Laayiɗ nga ɓa woyee ne : « A <char style="w">jiini</char> na ɗe, a dof ; wa ye tah ɗu sikɗukee ɗe ? » <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Ɓum woyeeɗa ne : « Woo ceem woo ɓo' huniɗ na jiini haa. Jiini minɗi hotiɗ fuuliɗ ! »<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kosaat sagu in ci mi na tume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Feet raakka ŋ Yerusalem, wa hendee ŋ jamano soos, wa nikee naandsukiŋ mbehi ɓa tumoh kahan Kooh kahan hooliɗ wuu ce. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yeesu nikee ŋ kahan Kooh, a tiindsukeeɗa ŋ ɗiska na woyse Perngaŋ-Suleymaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Yawuut ca ndeerra ɗe ; ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Fu faɗan ɓoo ŋ kumpa po kiɗa ? Nik ne a fu <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> ɗah, woya ɓoo wa hooliɗ. »<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa, te ɗu kosɗi so. In ci mi na tume ŋ tiikiŋ Baabiŋ ngo ceɗ na seede'ee so. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Waaye ɗu, ɗu kosɗi, sagu ne ɗu ɓaahɗi ŋ mbaal ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Mbaal ciŋ ngo na sikɗuke sikɗuk hoosooriŋ ngo, ŋ inhiɗ ca te ca ɗii ñaakiɗ to. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Te mi na onee ɓi na ñaakɗee so kipes ki reehanɗi, ɓa sooƴanɗi, ɓa hey pese po faw te ali ɓo' kooɗohanɗi ɓa ŋ yaahiŋ ngo. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Baabiŋ ngo yi eɗ to ɓa, a yi uup yak in nu nik te ali ɓo' minɗi kooɗoh in ŋ yaahiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Mi na Baabi, ɓoo yino. »<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Ɓa parhissa atoh ne ɓa tapsoh ɗe po a kaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ tumiɗ in baahiɗ laayiɗ ŋ fikiiɗu puloh ŋ Baabi. A winde nga ca tah ɗu hee so tapsohe ? » <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « E in baahiɗ tah po ɓoo hee ɗa tapsohe haa, waaye fu na ɓase Kooh. Fu ɓo' dong, fu dege haf fu Kooh, ineem weɗ tah. » <verse eid="JHN 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ waasiŋ ɗu, Fiis ci woyiɗ ne Kooh woyiɗ inii : “ Ŋ woo ne : Ɗu kooh ! ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Sabuur 82:6</ref></char></note> Wa ɗaa haa e ? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Ndeem ɓooɓi Kooh woyee na ɓa woo keem, a ɓeeɗkoh ɓa kooh ci ; te ali ɓo' minɗi nihis ini Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Mi, a Baabi tum mbo ɓo' hooliɗ wuu ce, a woossa so ŋ Adina. Ɗu min na woyoh ne mi na ɓase Kooh ŋ ini ŋ woo ne : “ Ŋ <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>. ” ? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Nik ne ŋ tumɗi pangkiŋ Baabiŋ ngo ɗah, kinaat to kos. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Waaye nik ne weɗ mi na tume ɗah, ali nik ne ɗu kosɗi so sah, kosaat sagu in ci mi na tume. Ŋ ineem, ɗu hey inhe baahiɗ ne Baabi yii nga so te mi yii ŋ Baabi. » <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Ɓa waaɗissa ɗe amb waaye a fussa ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>A kurkohha Yerusalem, a dokukka ɓaka winooraŋ kalaŋ Yurdan, ŋ ɗiska <char style="w">Yahya</char> meeɗ ɓoktoh, a nikka nga. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Ɓo' laayiɗ hayeeɗa nga ɗe. Ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Yahya tumɗi ali keemaan, waaye ini a woo ŋ ƴaarii jen wa keeh. » <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Ndeem, laayiɗ kossa Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kaŋ Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1-2"/>Wa raakeen ƴaar teeku Lasaar, a kosaayya. A genee Betani, a yi na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ɓitiɓ ci Mari na Marta. Mari, a yi yiifan kot ciŋ Yeesu laackoloñ, a moos ca na findiŋ ɗe. E taambɗoh ce Lasaar kosaaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Taambɗoh ciŋ Lasaar ɓeem woosohha ŋ Yeesu ne a woysaat ne nawleece kosaayiɗ.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Wa Yeesu woyuu wa, a woosa ne : « Kosaay keem hay ne wa ap haa ; waaye wa na hee teeɓohe yaki Kooh yak, jaar yaki <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> yak hotuk nga. » <verse eid="JHN 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Raak Yeesu nawle'koheen na Marta na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe Mari na Lasaar.<verse eid="JHN 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Waaye wa a kerah ne Lasaar kosaayiɗ, a ɓoofissa neeh kanak ŋ ɗiska a nike ; <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>ƴutta, a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɓoo dokkaat Yudee. » <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, maañaaɗi an Yawuut ci waaɗee ɗa tapsoh atoh ne ɓa ap ɗa, fu dokkissee nga e ? » <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ca wahtu ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12) ceɗ raak ŋ mbehi. Ɓo' nu tiind na noh ɗah, a hey hote siñaariŋ Adina, a kafndukanɗi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Waaye ɓo' nu tiind na wek ɗah, a raakanɗi siñaari niitɗan ɗe, a hey kafnduke. »<verse eid="JHN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Wi a woo ineem, a degga nga ne : « Lasaar nawle ɓoo neehiɗ, waaye maa kaɗ ɗe yuna. » <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Taalubeeci woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, nik ne a neehiɗ ɗah, a hey wire. » <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Yeesu woyee ɓa ndeem ne Lasaar kaaniɗ waaye ɓa liiɓee ne a woo neeh moɗoɗ. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Weɗi a woyoh ɓa hooliɗ ne : « Lasaar kaaniɗ ; <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>te ŋ sumiɗ saguuɗu ŋ ini ŋ nikeeɗi ndaam. Ŋ ineem, ɗu hey yo mine kos. Ɗiski wa nik, ɓoo kaɗaat nga ɗe. » <verse eid="JHN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Ŋ ineem Tomaa, yi na woyse Siisi, woosa taalubeeci ɓinooɓi ne : « Ɓoo kaɗaat, ɓoo nama kaan na kilifaani. »<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hultiɗuukaŋ Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Wa Yeesu kaɗ po a reesa ɗiska, a hotta ne Lasaar tumiɗ neeh nikiis ŋ ruy-ruya. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Betani useeɗi Yerusalem, harmban ca joyeen nik <char style="tl">kilomeet</char> kaahay. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Te Yawuut laayiɗ hayeen ŋ Marta na Mari ne ɓa corok ɓa ŋ kakaan kiŋ taambɗoh ɓa Lasaar.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Wa Marta kerah ne Yeesu yaa hay, a kaɗta coha na ɗe. Mari tassa ŋ kahna. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Marta woosa Yeesu ne : « Heɗi, fu nikeen nga ɗah, taambɗoh ho heeɗi kaane. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Waaye po ɗiski wa nik sah, ŋ inhiɗ ne in nu fu kiim Kooh ɗah, a on ɗa wa. » <verse eid="JHN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Taambɗoh fu hey hulte. » <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Marta woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ ne a hey hulte ŋ hultaŋ kaaniɗ ca ngaŋ mbeha mirndoh. » <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « A mi hultuki, a mi kipes ki. Ɓo' nu kos so ɗah, a hey pese, ali a kaan sah. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Te ɓi na pese jen, kossa so, ɓa heyɗi kaane muk. Fu kosiɗ ineem e ? » <verse eid="JHN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Marta woosa ɗe ne : « Ee, Heɗi, ŋ kosiɗ ne a fu <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, Kuɓkiŋ Kooh, yi joyee hay Adina. »<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Wa Marta woo ineem, a kaɗta, a ɓeeɗukka taambɗoh ce Mari, a woosa ɗe ŋ kehƴi ne : « Jangɗohohi hayiɗ, a woo ne fu tahsaa ɗe. » <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mari kerah kerah woo keem rek, a jaarra kuruk, a kaɗeeɗa ŋ Yeesu, <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>raak Yeesu aasɗi kur ka paaɗ, a risee ŋ ɗiska Marta cohee na ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Yawuut laayiɗ nikeen na Mari ŋ kahna giifɗeeɗa ɗe. Wa ɓa hot ɗe gooñkiɗ pulla, ɓa ñaakiɗta ɗe, ɓa liiɓee ne a na kee fuɗa ŋ ruy-ruya.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Wa Mari ree, a hot hot Yeesu, a keennda ŋ kot ciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, fu nikeen nga ɗah, taambɗoh ho heeɗi kaane. » <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Wa Yeesu hot Mari rooyeeɗa, a yi na Yawuut ca hunee na ɗe, a fuuppa sagu ayruk, wa yoondiɗta ɗe po a yegiɗtaa faaniŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu ɗaak ɗe ŋ winde ruy-ruy ? » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, haya fu hot. » <verse eid="JHN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yeesu fuɗta. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Weɗ Yawuut ca woyoh ne : « Markaat rek findi a waaɗohee ɗe ! » <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Waaye raakka ɓa woo ne : « A yi hotiɗ fuulɗi, a mineeɗi nam tum po Lasaar kaanuu e ? »<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yeesu fuupissa sagu ayruk, a kaɗta ruy-ruya ; wa nikee hur atoh, wa ranguusa na atoh yakak. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Nihsaat atoh fi. » Marta, taambɗoh kaanɗa woosa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, a joyiɗ raak het, ina a ɗaakohu ndii wa tumiɗ neeh nikiis. » <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ wooɗi ɗa ne fu kos ɗah, fu hey hote findi Kooh yakoh e ? »<verse eid="JHN 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Ŋ ineem ɓa nihissa atoh fa, Yeesu taaknukka ŋ Eel ci, a woosa ne : « Baab, mi yii corkiɗ ɗa ŋ ini fu teyɗukiɗ to. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ŋ inhiɗ ne fu gen ndo teyɗukiɗ, waaye ŋ woyiɗ sagu mboolndi wil lo, ne ɓa min kos ne a fu woos so. » <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Wi a ƴut woo ineem, a leehukka ŋ ɗafka ne : « Lasaar, pula fu hay ndii. » <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Kaanɗa pulla na kot ciŋ ɗe na yaah ciŋ ɗe liwuuɗ na uuf, fikiiriŋ ɗe muuruusa na piis. Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Toksaat ɗe, ɗu faɗ ɗe a coot. »<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilifaaca tufkiɗ ne ɓa hey ape Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Yawuut laayiɗ ŋ ɓa hayee ŋ Mari te ɓa hotta in ca Yeesu haɓiɗ, kossa ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Waaye raakka ɓa kaɗ ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca, ɓa woosa ɓa in ca Yeesu haɓiɗ. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Weɗi kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca cohɗohoh <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ atte'oh ci">saangnaŋ atte'oh ca</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:47 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">saangniŋ atte'oh ci </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoonaŋ Yeesu, a seeƴkiɗohi yakki adgohee wa, wa nikee a yi na ɓi wil ɗe, na ɓi yakak ŋ kur ka, na jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi. Ɓooɓeem ɓeɗ meeɗ coh ne ɓa atte'ee ɓooɓi ɗal ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>. Ɓa mineen ambɗuk ɓo' waaye ɓa mineeɗi ɗe apoot ne ɓa hot ne a joy joy apu ɗah, ɓa meeɗ ɗe ɓay ŋ atte'oh ci nikiɗ <char style="w">Rom</char> ŋ ndaam.</char></note>, ɓa woosa ne : « Ɓoo joy na tum ? Ƴaarii keemaan ci a na tume ca ɗii laay kat ! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Ɓoo faɗ ɗe an ɗah, ɓooɓi jen hey ɗe kose te ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> hey haye yahrohe Ɗiskiŋ ɓoo Hooliɗi, ɓa sañ cuuɓiŋ ɓoo. »<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Ƴaar nga ɓa teeksee Kayif, a yi nikee seeƴkiɗoha yakka ŋ kiis kaam, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inahɗi ini raak. <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Ɗu inahɗi ne ɓo' yino kaan wuu cuuɓi, weɗ ngisoh nga ɗu, kur ki jen sañu. » <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>A woyiɗ woo keem waaye wa pulohɗi nga ɗe. Nika a nikee seeƴkiɗoha yakka ŋ kiis ka, weɗ tah a yegɗohha findi woosuuɗ ne Yeesu hey kaane wuu cuuɓi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Wa nikɗi ne a joyee kaan wuu cuuɓi dong, waaye a kaaniɗ ne a cohɗoh kuɓuuciŋ Kooh pasarkohiɗ ci, ɓa nik cuuɓ yino.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Mbaɗi, weɗ ɓa tufkoh ne ɓa hey ɗe ape. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Ŋ ineem Yeesu tiindtiɗohisɗi halang ŋ ɗooƴ Yawuut ca. A pulohha ndaam, a kaɗta ŋ kur teeku Efrayim ŋ sero kehƴa hulanga ; a nikka nga a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Wa raak feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paakiŋ</char></char> Yawuut ci reɓeeɗa, ɓo' laayiɗ pulohha kur caŋ ɓa kaɗeeɗa Yerusalem ne ɓa farsuka bala feeti reyan. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Ɓa waakeeɗa Yeesu te ŋ ɗiska ɓa nikee ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> ɓa meeksoheeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ɗu hotoha na ? Ɗu liiɓiɗ ne a hey haye ŋ feeti e ? » <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Waam kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca nakoheen ne, ɓo' nu inah ɗiski Yeesu nik ɗah, ɓa woyaat ɓa wa, ne a min ambu.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mari yiifiɗ laackoloñ ŋ kot ciŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Neeh yasna-yino bala feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paakiŋ</char></char> Yawuut ci reyan ɗah, Yeesu hayya Betani kur ka Lasaar yi a hultiɗee genohe. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>A haɓɗiɗuusa kañam yakak nga, e Marta noɗohee kañam ka, Lasaar ɓaahee ŋ ɓi ñamee na Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Mari ɓayya haaƴ <char style="tl">liitar</char> laackoloñ ye ɗoɓan, haɓɗohu <char style="tl">narda</char> koceet, a yiiffaa ŋ kot ciŋ Yeesu, a mooseeɗa ca na findiŋ ɗe. Kahna jen eeñeeɗa laackoloñ. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Yudaa Iskaryot, yino ŋ taalubeeciŋ Yeesu, yi eɗndohan ɗe, woosa ne : <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>« Wa ye tah laackoloñi toonuuɗi ? Wa heen eɗohe kopor laayoh na laayoh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"kopor laayiɗ" : ŋ Fiis ci ndii, gerek woo ne "<char style="tl">dinaar</char> teemet-kaahay (300)". <char style="tl">Dinaar</char>, wa hanjar haalis, <char style="tl">dinaar</char> yino weɗ pangkoh bumit wirndassee ŋ neeh yino ŋ jamanoonaam.</char></note>, ñakiɗ ci eɗuu wa. » <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>A woyeeɗi ineem sagu ñakiɗ ci, waaye a niki a nikee rokoh tahe. A yi ambohee kopori, te a meeɗ meeɗ ɓay nga.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Waaye Yeesu woosa ne : « Faɗa ɓitɓi yel, ini a tum weem, a na kooɗkiɗe mbehi ŋ ɓekohsan ŋ ruy-ruy. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Ñakiɗ ci risan na ɗu ; waaye mi, ŋ risanɗi na ɗu. »<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca tufkiɗ ne ɓa ap Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Wa ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ Yawuut ca kerah ne Yeesu yaa ŋ Betani, ɓa kaɗta nga. Ɓa kaɗee ne ɓa marak Yeesu dong haa, waaye ɓa namee waaɗ hotndoh Lasaar yi a hultiɗe. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca tufukka ne ɓa hey name ap Lasaar, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>laam saguuce, Yawuut laayiɗ faɗeen ɓa, kossa Yeesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aasaŋ Yeesu Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Wa Kooh wiis, mboolnda yakka hayee ŋ feetaŋ <char style="tl">Paaka</char> kerahha ne Yeesu yii hay Yerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Ɓooɓa ɓayya raang tandarma, ɓa kaɗta coha na ɗe, ɓa leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">« <char style="tl">Hosaana</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Hosaana</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ ɗeɓgaana, wa tokseen ne : "Woti-woti, mucɗa ɓoo." Wa nikee kiim Kooh. Waaye, wa kaɗta po wa nikka woo yakɗoha Kooh.</char></note> !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Ɓoyi na haye ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">a raakaat barke !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Buuriŋ Israayel barke'aat !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sabuur 118:26</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yeesu ɓayya cumbur mbaam a rappa ɗe, findi Fiis ci woyoha an :<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>« Kur kiŋ Siyong<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Siyong </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa ɓaah ŋ tiik ciŋ Yerusalem.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">fu na neƴƴohe ye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:16">Sofooni 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:9">Esayi 40:9</ref></char></note> ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Buuriŋ ɗa yii hay,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">rapiɗ ŋ cumbur mbaam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Sakriya 9:9</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe inheeɗi paaɗ ini in ceem tokis, waaye wi yaki Yeesu yak teeɓohu, ɓa naandsukka ne Fiis ci woyeen in ceem nga ɗe, te ca raakohha ɗaa nga ɗe findi ca woyohse.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Mboolnda maasoh wa Yeesu ɓeeɗuk Lasaar ŋ ɗooƴ ruy-ruya, hultiɗta ɗe, ɓa seede'eeɗa ini ɓa hot. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Weɗ tah mboolo keeh-keeh weɗ kaɗ ɗe taambka, sagu firndeena ɓa kerhee ne weɗ a tum.<verse eid="JHN 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>
    <char style="w">
      <char style="tl">Farisen</char>
    </char> ca woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ɗu hot nga, ɓoo minɗi ali in nga ; markaat, ɓooɓi jen ɓa ɗii ñaakiɗ ɗe ! »<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Raakiɗ ɓi <char style="w">Gerek</char> ɓi ɓaahee ŋ ɓooɓa hayee Yerusalem ne ɓa ñaamuk Kooh ŋ feetaŋ Yawuut ca. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Ɓa kaɗta ŋ Filip yi genee Betsayda ŋ Galile, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ɓoo waaɗ hot Yeesu. » <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filip kaɗta woosa Andare wa, Andare hunnda na ɗe, ɓa kaɗta ɓa woosa Yeesu wa.<verse eid="JHN 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Jamanooni yaki <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> yak joy teeɓohu reyiɗ kotii. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, feeh tisohiŋ tohri keenɗi ŋ kehƴi po wa mand na ini kaan ɗah, wa risan yino. Waaye wa eɗoh kipes kiŋ wa ɗah, wa hey rime laayiɗ. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Ɓo' nu waaɗ kipes kiŋ ɗe ɗah, a heya ñake. Waaye, ɓo' nu waaɗootɗi kipes kiŋ ɗe ŋ adinaanii ɗah, a heya ɗaake wuu kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Ɓo' nu waaɗ to pangkiɗ ɗah, a ñaakɗaat to te ɗisik nu ŋ nik ɗah, surgaaniŋ ngo naman nik nga. Ɓooɓi na pangkiɗee so jen, e Baabiŋ ngo na hee ɓa yakɗe.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>Ɗiski wa nik, ŋ jahaskohiɗ ! Moo ŋ woyan na ? Andi maa hee woye ne “ Baab, muciɗ to ŋ ini na hee raake ŋ neeh cii ? ” Waaye ini joy raak ŋ neeh cii weɗ tah ho hay ! <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Kon Baab yakɗa tiikiŋ ɗa ! » Teemb ndeem, hooso pulohha Eel ci an : « Ŋ yakɗiɗ tiikiŋ ngo te ŋ heya yakɗisse. » <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Mboolnda nikee ŋ ndaam kerahha hoosoora, ɓum woyeeɗa ne wa inding, ɓinooɓi woyeeɗa ne a malaaka woo na ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Weɗ Yeesu woyoh ɓa ne : « A saguuso tah hoosooreem kerhuk haa, waaye e ɗu tah. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Adinaanii hey atte'se kotii ; yi dega yaah aañu ŋ hara. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Ini kaɗ nga so nak, ŋ meeɓu, ŋ tiimb kehƴi ɗah, ŋ hey nooke ɓooɓi jen nga so. » <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Ŋ woo keem, Yeesu teeɓohee findi a na hee kaanohe.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Mboolnda loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo kerhiɗ ne waasiŋ ɓoo woo ne <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> na hee hey pese po faw.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sabuur 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Esayi 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dañeel 7:14</ref></char></note> Fu min na woyoh ne Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi joyiɗ meeɓu, tiimb kehƴi ? Kon a ya ɓa Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi ? »<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Siñaari wa ɗii risohaahha na ɗu paaɗ ; kon tiindaat nga feeh ɗu ɓii raak siñaari ɗah, ŋ ineem ñuusi teluu ɗu ; laam ɓoyi na tiinde ŋ ñuus inahɗi ɗiski a na yurhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Mbaa feeh ɗu ɓii raak siñaari ɗah, kosaat siñaari, ne ɗu min nik kuɓu siñaar. » Wa a ƴut woo ineem, Yeesu kaɗta, a ɗasɗukka ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaa kos yegɗohiŋ ɓoo ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Firndeeca laayiɗ ca Yeesu teeɓohee ŋ fiki ɓooɓa, tahɗi po ɓa kossa ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Ineem raakeen ne ina woosuuɗi Esayi woyee raak, an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">« Heɗi, yaa kos yegɗohiŋ ɓoo ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Heɗi, fu teeɓ ya ɓa hatiliŋ ɗa ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Esayi 53:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Inii weɗ tah po ɓa mineeɗi kos, findi Esayi woyoha ne :<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>« Kooh fuulɗiɗ has ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">a ndengiɗta keeñ ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ne ɓa hotuu na has ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ɓa raakuu yeg-yeg ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ɓa ɓoƴsohuu pesohaaɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Ŋ ineem, ɓa sangiɗ ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">mi yi Kooh, ŋ wiriɗ ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Esayi 6:10</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Ineem weɗ Esayi woo sagu ne a hotiɗ yaki Yeesu yak te a woyiɗ ini kaɗ nga ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Moona ŋ kilifaacaŋ ɓa yakak ca sah, laayiɗ koseen ɗe ; waaye <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca taheen po ɓa kaañeeɗaa woo, ɓa neƴƴohee aañu ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ca. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Laam yakɗa ɓooɓa yakɗee ɓa weɗ ngisohiɗ ɓa wi Kooh yakɗan ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">A woo ciŋ Yeesu atte'an kosaaɗiici</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yeesu woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Yaa nu kos so ɗah, a kos so dong haa, waaye a namiɗ kos Yi woos so. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Te yaa nu hot to ɗah, a hotiɗ Yi woos so. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Mi, ŋ hayiɗ Adina ne ŋ nik siñaariŋ wa, ne yaa nu kos so ɗah, a risuu ŋ ñuus. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Ɓo' kerah woo kiŋ ngo te a taambiɗɗaa ɗah, a ñam atte'an ɗe haa ; laam ŋ hayɗi ne ŋ atte Adina waaye ŋ hay ne ŋ muciɗa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Yaa nu heef fo, a teyɗukɗi woo ciŋ ngo ɗah, a raakiɗ atte'oh : Woo ciŋ ngo, ceɗ na hee ɗe atte'e ŋ mbeha mirndoh.<verse eid="JHN 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Laam mi, ŋ wooɗi ŋ njungiŋ ngo haf fo ; Baabi woos so, a yi ŋ haf ce, a yi nak ko ini ŋ joy woo na wi ŋ joy yegɗoh. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Te ŋ inhiɗ ne nakohiŋ ɗe na onohe kipes ki heyɗi reehe. Te ini mi na woye, mi na woyee wa findi Baabi woyoh ho wa. »<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu naawsiɗ kot ciŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Wa nikee bala feetiŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> reyan, te Yeesu inheen ne jamanooni a joy puloh Adina a kaɗ ŋ Baabi reyiɗ. A waaɗeen ɓooɓiŋ ɗe nik ŋ Adina, te a waaɗta ɓa po ɗiska waaɗ top.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Na niina, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe nikee ñameeɗa. Raak Seytaani ɓekiɗ ŋ keeñiŋ Yudaa kuɓkiŋ Simong Iskaryot ne a eɗndoh ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Yeesu inheen ne Baabi faɗiɗ in ci jen ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe. A nameen inah ne, a puloh ŋ Kooh te a na dokke nga ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>A kurukka, a wolissa kulɓaakaŋ ɗe yakka, a ɓayya mooskoha, a tokɗukkaa. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>A neyya masuɓ ŋ inaa, a naawsiɗeeɗa taalubeeciŋ ɗe kot, a mooseeɗa ca na mooskohaana a tokɗuke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ jamanoonaam, hanhe hayeen ɗah, a <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> kahni meeɗ ɓay masuɓ, naawsiɗ ɗe kot ciŋ ɗe, a moos ca.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Wa a kaɗ po a reesa ŋ Simong Piyeer, yeem woosa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, a fu naawsiɗan ndo kot e ? » <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ɗiski wa nik, fu inahɗi ini mi na haɓɗe waaye mbeh, fu hey wa inhe. » <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Fu moosanɗi so naawsiɗ kot muk ! » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ŋ naawsiɗɗi ɗa kot ɗah, fu rahsohissanɗi in na so. » <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simong Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Mbaa Heɗi, fu topanɗi ŋ kot ci dong, waaye fu hey naawisndohe yaah ci na hafi. » <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoyi ɓookuk po ƴutta, a hooliɗ jen, a etohɗi ɓookkis, ɗal kot ci ɗah ; ɗu hooliɗ waaye e ɗu jen haa. » <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>A inheen ya ɓa nga ɓa na hee ɗe eɗndohe, weɗ tah a woosa ne : « E ɗu jen hool haa. »<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Wa a naawsiɗ ɓa kot po ƴutta, a ɓekkissa kulɓaakaŋ ɗe, a ɓooffa. A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu inhiɗ ini ŋ haɓɗiɗ ɗu e ? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Ɗu na ɓeeɗkohee so Jangɗohohi wala Heɗi ; te ɗu woo keeh, weɗ ŋ nik. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Kon mi yi Heɗi, mi yi Jangɗohohi, ŋ naawsiɗiɗ ɗu kot ciŋ ɗu ɗah, yaa nu nga ɗu ɗah joyiɗ nam naawsiɗ morom ce kot. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Ŋ teeɓiɗ ɗu findi wa tumohsan ne findi ŋ tumoh na ɗu, ɗu namee tumoh ɗaa. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, te ambaat ne wa keeh, ñaam uupuu heɗ ce te yi woosu minɗi uup yi woos ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Ɗiski wa nik, ɗu inhiɗ ineem, ɗu tuma ɗah, ɗu hey neɓɗe.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>E ɗu jen na tahee so woo haa, ŋ inhiɗ baahiɗ ɓi ŋ kooɗ. Waaye ini Fiis ci woo joyiɗ raak, an : “ Yi na ɓaahe na so bool yino, tapiɗ to mbalnguus.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Sabuur 41:10</ref></char></note> ” <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu ineem woti, bala wa hayan ɗah, ne wa hay ɗah, ɗu kos ne ñam nik. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, te ambaat ne wa keeh, yaa nu teyɗuk yi ŋ woos ɗah, a teyɗuk ko, te yaa nu teyɗuk ko ɗah, a teyɗuk Yi woos so. »<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu teeɓohiɗ ne Yudaa hey ɗe eɗndohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo ineem, a jahaskohha ŋ ɗooƴ ce, a woosa halang ne : « Ñam woo ɗu wa, te ambaat ne wa keeh, yino nga ɗu hey yo eɗndohe. » <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Taalubeeci markoheeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓa inheeɗi ɓoyi a joy nik.<verse eid="JHN 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Yino ŋ taalubeeci, yi Yeesu keeñkohe, nikee ɓoofiɗ ŋ serooce ŋ kañam ka. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simong Piyeer tummba ɗe na yaah ne a meekis Yeesu ɓoyi a na woye. <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Taalubeena hiirra ŋ Yeesu meekissa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, fu na woye ya ɓa ? » <verse eid="JHN 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ hey njeeɓe nguɗiŋ mbuurndii ŋ ɗooƴ kañam ki, ɓoyi maa hee wa eɗe, a yi. » Weɗ a njeeɓoh nguɗaŋ mbuurnda, a eɗta wa Yudaa kuɓkiŋ Simong Iskaryot.<verse eid="JHN 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yudaa ɓay ɓay mbuurnda rek Seytaani aassa ɗe. Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ini fu na hee haɓɗe, araa haɓiɗ. » <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Ali ɓo' ŋ ɓooɓa ɓinooɓa ɓoofee ŋ ɗiska ñameeɗa inheeɗi ini tah Yeesu woosa ɗe ineem. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>A Yudaa meeɗ ɗaak koporaŋ ɓa, weɗ tah raakka ɓi liiɓee ne Yeesu na nakee ɗe ne a rom ini ɓa etoh ŋ feeta, wala a eɗ ñakiɗ ca in. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Wa Yudaa ɓay nguɗaŋ mbuurnda, jaarra pul, wa nikee ŋ ndengelnde wek.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nakohi asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Wa Yudaa pul, Yeesu woosa ne : « Ɗiski wa nik, jamanooni <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> yakɗohsan reyiɗ, te yaki Kooh yak hey hotke nga ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>[Nik ne yaki Kooh yak hotkan taamboh nga ɗe ɗah,] Kooh hey ɗe name yakiɗ ngaŋ haf ce, te jamanooni a na hee wa tumohe hayiɗ kotii. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, mi yii na ɗu poyi, waaye wa maañisɗi. Ɗu hey yo waake waaye ina ŋ woyee kilifaaciŋ Yawuut ci weɗ maa hee ɗu woye : Ɗiski mi na kaɗe, ɗu minɗi kaɗ nga.<verse eid="JHN 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Mi yii eɗ ɗu nakoh as : Waaɗtiɗohaat ŋ harmban ɗu. Findi ŋ waaɗoh ɗu, namaat waaɗtiɗoh ɗaa ŋ harmban ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Ɗu waaɗtiɗoh ŋ harmban ɗu ɗah, ɓooɓi jen hey inhe ne ɗu taalubeeciŋ ngo. »<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ ne Piyeer hey ɗe taaske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simong Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, fu na kaɗe nde ? » Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ɗiski wa nik, fu minɗi so ñaakiɗ ŋ ɗiski mi na kaɗe, waaye ƴut ɗah, fu hey yo ñaakɗe. » <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, wa ye tah ɗiski wa nik ŋ minɗi ɗa ñaakiɗ ? Ŋ ƴutiɗ ne ŋ eɗoh kiñin kiŋ ngo wuu fu ! » <verse eid="JHN 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fu ƴutiɗ ne fu eɗoh kiñin kiŋ ɗa wuu so i ? Ñam na woyee ɗa wa, te amba ne wa keeh, bala siiki leehkan ɗah, fu hey yo taaske waas kaahay. »<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu a yi waasi kaɗ ŋ Baabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Weɗi Yeesu woyoh taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Kinaat jaahiɗ, kosaat Kooh te ɗu nam mbo kos. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Kahan Baabiŋ ngo raakiɗ genoha laayiɗ ; wa nikeeɗi ɗah ŋ heen ɗu wa woye ; mi na kee ɗu kooɗkiɗa ɗiski ɗu nikan. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Te ŋ kaɗ po ŋ kooɗkiɗ ɗu ɗiska ɗu nikan po ƴut ɗah, ŋ hey hayisse, ŋ ɓay ɗu ŋ serooso, ne ɗiski ŋ nik, ɗu nam nik nga. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Te ɗiski mi na kaɗe, ɗu inhiɗ waasiŋ wa. »<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomaa woosa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, ɓoo inahɗi ɗiski fu na kaɗe, ɓoo min na inhoh waasi ? » <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « A mi waasi na keeh ki na kipes ki. Ali ɓo' minɗi kaɗ ŋ Baabi te a lahɗi nga so. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Ɗu inhiɗ to ɗah, ɗu hey name inah Baabiŋ ngo, te ini kooɗoh woti, ɗu inhiɗ ɗe, ɗu hotiɗ ɗe. »<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filip woosa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, teeɓa ɓoo Baabi, ineem hey ɓoo doye. » <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Na maañi ŋ maañ na ɗu jen, fu inahɗi so poyi e Filip ? Ɓo' nu hot to ɗah, a hotiɗ Baabi, mbaa fu min na woyoh ne : “ Teeɓa ɓoo Baabi ” ? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Fu kosɗi ne mi yii ŋ Baabi te Baabi yii nga so e ? Woo ci mi na woyee ɗu na puloheeɗi nga so, a Baabi gen nga so na tume tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Kosaat to ŋ ini ŋ woo ɗu ne mi yii ŋ Baabi te Baabi yii nga so ; wala sah ɗu kos sagu in ci ɗu hot to tume.<verse eid="JHN 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, yaa nu kos so ɗah, a hey name haɓiɗ in ci mi na haɓɗe ; a hey haɓɗe ci uup ca yak sah, laam mi na kaɗe ŋ Baabi. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>In nu ɗu kiim ŋ tiikiŋ ngo ɗah, ŋ heya tume ne <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> teeɓoh yaki Baabi yak. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Ɗu kiim mbo in ŋ tiikiŋ ngo ɗah, ŋ heya tume. »<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu gapohiɗ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>Yeesu woyissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɗu waaɗ to ɗah, ɗu hey taambɗe nakoh ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Te ŋ hey kiime Baabi, a eɗ ɗu Ɓaatɗohoh wiiriis ne a nik na ɗu po faw. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>A <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>. A yi na teeɓohe keeh ki ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kooh ; ɓi Adina minɗi ɗe teyɗuk laam ɓa minɗi ɗe hot te ɓa inahɗi ɗe. Waaye ɗu, ɗu inhiɗ ɗe, a yii na ɗu te a nikan nga ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>Ŋ faɗanɗi ɗu ɗu nik komaaki yaɗu, ŋ hey hayisse nga ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Tas ƴissuut ɓi Adina hotissanɗi so waaye ɗu, ɗu hey yo hote, laam mi yii pes, te ɗu hey name pes. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Mbeheem ree ɗah, ɗu hey inhe ne mi yii ŋ Baabiŋ ngo, ɗu ɓii nga so te mi yii nga ɗu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>Ɓoyi waaɗ to, a yi ɓoyi amb nakoh ciŋ ngo te a taambɗee ca ; ɓoyi waaɗ to, Baabiŋ ngo hey ɗe waaɗe ; te mi, ŋ hey ɗe waaɗe, te ŋ hey ɗe teeɓe ini ŋ nik. »<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Yudaa, ɓaahɗi na Yudaa Iskaryot meekissa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, wa ye raak po fu na hee ɓoo teeɓke dong, fu heyɗi teeɓke adinaani jen ? » <verse eid="JHN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓo' nu waaɗ to ɗah, a hey ambe woo kiŋ ngo. Baabiŋ ngo hey ɗe waaɗe, ɓoo hun hay nga ɗe te ɓoo gen na ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Ɓo' nu waaɗɗi so ɗah, a taambɗanɗi woo ciŋ ngo. Te inhaat ne woo ci ɗu na kerhe ŋ woyee ca, ca pulohɗi nga so, ca puloh ŋ Baabi woos so.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu woo ceem, ŋ ini ŋ ris nik na ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Waaye Ɓaatɗohohi, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani Baabi na hee woose ŋ tiikiŋ ngo, hey ɗu jangɗe in ci ɗu joy inah jen, a naandis ɗu in ci ŋ woo ɗu jen.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>Jam weɗ ŋ faɗ na ɗu, jamiŋ ngo weɗ ŋ on ɗu, ŋ onɗi ɗu jam findi Adina na onohee wa. Mbaa kinaat jaahiɗ te kinaat neƴƴoh.<verse eid="JHN 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Ɗu kerhiɗ to woyeeɗa ne : “ Mi yii kaɗ te ŋ hey hayisse nga ɗu. ” Ɗu waaɗeen ndo ɗah, ɗu heen neɓse ŋ ini maa kaɗe ŋ Baabi, laam a Baabi uup po. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu in ceem woti, bala ca hayan, ne ca hay ɗah, ɗu kos. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Ŋ heyɗi woyisse na ɗu laayiɗ laam yi deg adinaanii yaah yii hay. A miniɗɗi so ali in, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>waaye adinaani joyiɗ inah ne ŋ waaɗiɗ Baabi te mi na tumohe findi Baabi nakoh ho. Kurkaat ndii, ɓoo coot. »<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Kidgiŋ reseñi na naak ciŋ wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « A mi kidgiŋ reseñi keeh-keehi, Baabiŋ ngo nikka guurohi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Naak nu nik nga so te wa raakɗi rim ɗah, a hey wa nguɗe. Waaye waa nu raak rim ɗah, a hey wa carse po wa hool ne wa ɓaat rim. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Ɗu nak, ɗu hooliɗ po ƴutiɗ sagu woo ci ŋ woo ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Genaat nga so findi ŋ genoh nga ɗu ; naak minɗi raak rim kiik wa, wa joy gen amb ŋ kidgi. Wa mand ɗaa nga ɗu, ɗu minɗi raak rim ne ɗu genɗi amb nga so ɗah.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>A mi kidgiŋ reseñi, e ɗu naak ci. Ɓo' nu gen nga so findi ŋ genoh nga ɗe ɗah, a hey raake rim laayiɗ laam ɗu nikɗi nga so ɗah ɗu minɗi haɓiɗ ali in. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Ɓo' nu genɗi nga so ɗah, a hey mbetse ŋ hara findi naak ci baahaaɗiici. Ca suy ɗah, ca nangɗohu, ca njafu ŋ yongkaaha, ca doh.<verse eid="JHN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Ɗu gen nga so te woo kiŋ ngo gen ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɗu ɗah, kiimaat in nu ɗu waaɗ ɗah, wa raakohan ɗaa nga ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Ɗu raak rim laayiɗ ɗah, ɗu hey teeɓohe ne ɗu taalubeeciŋ ngo te wa hey teeɓohe yaki Baabiŋ ngo yak. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Findi Baabi waaɗoh ho, ŋ nam ɗu waaɗoh ɗaa. Genaat ŋ waaɗi ŋ waaɗ ɗu weem. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Ɗu taambiɗ nakoh ciŋ ngo ɗah, ɗu hey gene ŋ waaɗi ŋ waaɗ ɗu, findi ŋ taambɗoh nakoh ciŋ Baabiŋ ngo te ŋ geniɗ ŋ waaɗi a waaɗ to.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu in ceem ne sumi ŋ sum nik nga ɗu, te sumiŋ ɗu mit sik. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Inii weɗ ŋ nakoh : Waaɗtiɗohaat ŋ harmban ɗu findi ŋ waaɗoh ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Ɓoyi eɗoh kiñin kiŋ ɗe sagu nawleeciŋ ɗe, raakɗi waaɗ-waaɗi uup yak waaɗ-waaɗeem. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Ɗu nawleeciŋ ngo, ne ɗu haɓiɗ ini ŋ nak ɗu ɗah. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Ŋ ɓeeɗkohissanɗi ɗu <char style="w">ñaam</char>, laam ñaam na inheeɗi ini heɗ ce na haɓɗe. Mi, ŋ inhiɗiɗ ɗu ini ŋ kerhoh ŋ Baabiŋ ngo jen, tahha po ŋ ɓeeɗkohan ɗu nawleeciŋ ngo kotii.<verse eid="JHN 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>E ɗu tan ndo haa, ñam tan ɗu, ŋ tufkiɗta ɗu ne ɗu kaɗ, ɗu raak rim te ca nik rim ci genan gen. Ŋ ineem Baabi hey ɗu one in nu ɗu kiim ɗe ŋ tiikiŋ ngo ɗah. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Ini ŋ nak ɗu weɗ ne ɗu waaɗtiɗoh ŋ harmban ɗu. »<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adina sangiɗ Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>Yeesu woyissa ne : « Adina sang ɗu ɗah, inhaat ne wa koc co sang. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Ɗu ɓaaheen ŋ Adina ɗah, Adina heen ɗu waaɗe sagu waaɗi wa waaɗ ini wa raak. Waaye ɗu ɓaahɗi nga laam ŋ kooɗohiɗ ɗu ŋ ɗooƴ wa, weɗ tah wa sannga ɗu.<verse eid="JHN 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Kinaat alkoh woo ki ŋ woo ɗu ne : “ Ñaam uupuu heɗ ce. ” Nik ne ɓa tolfiɗ to ɗah, ɓa hey ɗu tolfiɗe. Ɓa ambiɗ jangɗohiŋ ngo ɗah, ɓa hey ambe wiŋ ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Waaye ineem jen ɓa hey ɗu wa tume saguuso laam ɓa inahɗi Yi woos so.<verse eid="JHN 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ŋ hayeeɗi te ŋ woyeeɗi na ɓa ɗah, ɓa heeɗi taambse bakaaɗ. Waaye ɗiski wa nik ɓa raakisɗi taaskoha ŋ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Yaa nu sang ngo ɗah, a nam sang Baabiŋ ngo. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Ŋ tumeeɗi ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa in ci ali ɓo' wiiriis tumɗi ɗah, ɓa heeɗi taambse bakaaɗ. Waaye ɗiski wa nik ɓa hotiɗ in ci ŋ tum te ɓa sangiɗ to, ɓa sangiɗ Baabiŋ ngo. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Waaye ineem raakiɗ ne woo ki fiisu ŋ waasiŋ ɓa raak, wa woo ne : “ Ɓa sangiɗ to te ɓa degɗaa ŋ ɗisik.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Sabuur 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:5">69:5</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>Ɓaatɗohohi ŋ woyee ne ŋ hey ɗu ɗe woosohe ŋ tiikiŋ Baabi, te a nikka <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> puloh ŋ Baabi ; a yi na teeɓohe keeh ki ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kooh ; a hay ɗah, a yi seede'an ndo. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Ɗu, ɗu hey yo name seede laam ŋ cambohaana poyi, ɗu ɓii na so. »<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>Yeesu woyissa ne : « Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu in cii ne ɗu raakuu ali ini tahan ɗu faɗ kosi ɗu kos. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Ɓa hey ɗu aañe ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci ; wa hey raake jamano sah wi fu inah ne ɓi apan ɗu, amban ne ɓa na ñaamke Kooh ŋ ineem. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Te ɓa hey haɓɗe ineem sagu ne ɓa inahɗi Baabi, ɓa inahɗi so. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Mi yii woo ɗu wa ne jamanooneem hay ɗah, ɗu naandsuk ne mi, ŋ woyeen ɗu wa. »</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Pangkiŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Yeesu degga nga ne : « Ŋ nikee na ɗu, tahha po in ceem, ŋ woyeeɗi ɗu ca ŋ cambohaana. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Ɗiski wa nik, mi yii kaɗeeɗa ŋ Yi woos so, te ali ɓo' nga ɗu meekisɗi so ɗiski mi na kaɗe. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Waaye keeñ ciŋ ɗu reehiɗ sagu ini ŋ woo ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Moona, ini mi na woyee ɗu wii, wa keeh : Ini ngisoh nga ɗu weɗ ne ŋ coot. Ŋ kaɗɗi ɗah, Ɓaatɗohohi hayanɗi nga ɗu. Waaye ŋ coot ɗah, ŋ hey ɗu ɗe woosohe.<verse eid="JHN 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>A hay ɗah, a hey raake keeh nga ɓi Adina ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ bakaaɗ, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ yurah, na ini kaɗ ŋ atteeniŋ Kooh. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>A hey raake keeh nga ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ bakaaɗ, laam ɓa kosɗi so. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>A hey raake keeh nga ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ yurah, laam mi yii kaɗ ŋ Baabi te ɗu hotissanɗi so. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>A hey raake keeh nga ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ atteeniŋ Kooh, laam yi deg adinaanii yaah atte'uuɗ po ƴutiɗ.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>Ŋ raakissiɗ in laayiɗ ci ŋ joy ɗu woo, waaye ɗiski wa nik ɗu antalɗi ca. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/><char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na teeɓohe keeh ki hay ɗah, a hey ɗu yurhiɗe ŋ keeh ki jen ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kooh. A woyanɗi ɗu woo kiŋ ɗe haf ce, waaye a woyan ɗu ini a kerah jen, te a hey ɗu yegɗe ini na haye. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>A hey teeɓohe yaki ŋ yak, a kooɗohan nga so, a woyee ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Ini Baabi raak jen, wa wiŋ ngo, weɗ tah ŋ woosa ɗu ne, a kooɗohan nga so, a woyee ɗu. »<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Keeñ ci hey mirndohe soos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>Yeesu woyissa ne : « Tas ƴissuut rek ɗu hotissanɗi so, te wa degis ƴissuut ɗah, ɗu hotis so. » <verse eid="JHN 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Ɓum ngaŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « A na waaɗe ɓoo ye woo an : “ Tas ƴissuut rek ɗu hotissanɗi so, te wa degis ƴissuut ɗah, ɗu hotis so. ” ? A ɓaatis nga ne “ Mi yii kaɗ ŋ Baabi. ” A waaɗ ye woo ŋ ineem ? <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>"Tas ƴissuuti" a woo, wa tokis ye ? Ɓoo inahɗi ini a waaɗ woo ndii. »<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yeesu inahha ne ɓa waaɗ ɗe meekis, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ woo ɗu ne : “ Tas ƴissuut rek, ɗu hotissanɗi so, te wa degis ƴissuut ɗah, ɗu hotis so. ” Ɗu na meeksohe ŋ harmban ɗu ini ŋ waaɗ woo ŋ ineem e ? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, ɗu hey fuɗe, ɗu miskiɗke, raakan Adina neɓsiɗke. Ɗu, ɗu hey raake keeñ reehiɗ, waaye keeñ ciŋ ɗu hey mirndohe soos. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Ɓitiɓ heesa ɓasle ɗah, keeñiŋ ɗe na reehe reeh, raakee e wahtuuniŋ ɗe ree ; waaye a raak kuɓki po ƴut ɗah, a na alkohe alkoh miskiɗa, sagu soosi keeñiŋ ɗe soos ŋ ini a ɓay ɓo' Adina.<verse eid="JHN 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Ɗu nak, ɗiski wa nik, keeñ ciŋ ɗu reehiɗ, waaye ŋ hey ɗu hotisse ; ndeem keeñ ciŋ ɗu hey soose, te ali ɓo' kooɗohanɗi sumeem nga ɗu. <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Ŋ mbeheem, ɗu heyɗi so meeksisse ali in. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:23">Yeesu woyissa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te ambaat ne wa keeh, in nu ɗu kiim Baabi ŋ tiikiŋ ngo ɗah, a hey ɗu wa one. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Po woti, ɗu kiimɗi ali in ŋ tiikiŋ ngo. Kiimaat te ɗu hey rahse, jaar sumiŋ ɗu mit.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu saahiɗ Adina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>Woo ceem, ŋ woyiɗ ɗu ca ŋ woyohaaɗ ; jamano weɗi hay ŋ woyissanɗi na ɗu ŋ woyohaaɗ, waaye ŋ woyan na ɗu halang ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Baabi. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Ŋ mbeheem, ɗu hey kiime Baabi ŋ tiikiŋ ngo, nikɗi haa ne a ñam kiimɗan ɗu Baabi. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Baabi ŋ haf ce a waaɗiɗ ɗu, sagu ini ɗu waaɗ to te ɗu nammba kos ne mi, ŋ puloh nga ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Ŋ puloh ŋ Baabi, ŋ hayya Adina ; ɗiski wa nik mi yii pul Adina, mi yii dokuk ŋ Baabi. »<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Aa ! Fu yii han woo halang kotii, fu woyisɗi ŋ woyohaaɗ. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Ɗiski wa nik, ɓoo inhiɗ ne fu inhiɗ jen, po sah, wa etohɗi ɓo' meeksee ɗa ; weɗ tah ɓoo kossa ne fu puloh ŋ Kooh. » <verse eid="JHN 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu kosiɗ kotii i ? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Inhaat ne wahtuuni weɗi hay te wa hayiɗ po ƴutiɗ, wi fu inah ne ɗu hey pasarkohe jen, yaa nu nga ɗah coot waas ce, ɗu faɗ to kiik ko ; waaye ŋ kiik ko haa, Baabi yii na so. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>In ceem, ŋ woyiɗ ɗu ca, ne ɗu min raak jam ŋ niki ɗu nik nga so. Ɗu hey raake miskiɗ ŋ Adina, waaye ndengɗukaat ! Mi, ŋ saahiɗ Adina. »<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu kiimɗiɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo in ceem, a taaknukka ŋ Eel ci, a woosa ne : « Baab, wahtuuni reyiɗ ! Teeɓoha yaki <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗa</char> yak ne Kuɓki teeɓoh yaki fu yak. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Laam fu oniɗ ɗe min-min ŋ ɗafuk ɓooɓi jen ne a on ɓi fu deg ŋ yaah ce jen kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Te kipes ki heyɗi reehe weɗ ne ɓa inah ɗa, fu yi Koohi yino-kongi ; te ɓa inah Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, yi fu woos.<verse eid="JHN 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Ŋ teeɓohiɗ ŋ kehƴi yaki fu yak, ŋ ɗiindohi ŋ ɗiindoh pangki fu nakee so. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Baab, ɗiski wa nik, eɗ to ŋ seroofu yaki ŋ yakee ŋ seroofu bala Adina fersan.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>Ɓooɓi ɓaahee ŋ Adina te fu degga ɓa ŋ yaah ho, ŋ inhiɗiɗ ɓa tiikiŋ ɗa. Ɓa nikee ɓiŋ ɗa, fu eɗta so ɓa, te ɓa taambɗiɗ woo kiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Ɓa inhiɗ kotii ne in ci fu eɗ to jen, ca puloh nga ɗa. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Ŋ wikiɗ ɓa woo ci fu woo so ne ŋ woo ɓa ca ; te ɓa teyiɗ ca, ɓa inhiɗ keeh-keeh ne ŋ puloh nga ɗa, te ɓa kosiɗ ne yaf woos so.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>Mi na kiimɗee ɓa. Ŋ kiimiɗɗi Adina, mi na kiimɗe ɓi fu eɗ to, laam ɓa ɓiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Ini ŋ raak jen, a fu raaka te ini fu raak, ñam raaka ; yaki ŋ yak teeɓohkiɗ nga ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Tas ƴissuut, ŋ nikissanɗi ŋ Adina, mi na hee nga ɗa, waaye ɓeɗ, ɓii ŋ Adina. Baab, fu yi Hooliɗi, niiɗaa ɓa ne ɓa min nik yino findi ɓoo nikoh yino mi na ɗa ; niiɗa ɓa ŋ hatiliŋ tiikiŋ ɗa, tiiki fu eɗ to.<verse eid="JHN 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Wa ŋ nik na ɓa, ŋ niiɗiɗ ɓa ŋ doolndiŋ tiikiŋ ɗa, tiiki fu eɗ to. Ŋ taambkohiɗ ɓa po ali yino sooƴɗi nga ɓa, ɗal yi joyee sooƴ ne ini Fiis ci woo raak. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Te ɗiski wa nik, mi yii hay nga ɗa ; mi yii woo woo cii ŋ ini ŋ ris ŋ Adina ne ɓa min sum sum kiŋ ngo, sum kiŋ ɓa mit. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Ŋ eɗiɗ ɓa woo kiŋ ɗa, te Adina sangiɗ ɓa sagu ini ɓa ɓaahɗi ŋ Adina, findi ŋ namɗi ɓaahoh nga.<verse eid="JHN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Ŋ kiimɗi ɗa ne fu kooɗoh ɓa ŋ Adina, waaye mi na kiimee ɗa ne fu niiɗ ɓa po Seytaani raakuu waas nga ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Ɓa ɓaahɗi ŋ Adina findi ŋ namɗi ɓaahoh nga. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Tufkiɗohaa ɓa keeh ki, ɓa nik ɓo' hooliɗ wuu fu ; woo kiŋ ɗa weɗ keeh ki. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Findi fu tuuƴoh ho ŋ Adina, ŋ tuuƴoh ɓa nga ɗaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Ŋ eɗiɗ ɗa haf fo jen, ŋ nikka wuu fu saguuɓa, ne ɓa nam eɗoh haf ɓa wuu fu taamboh ŋ woo kiŋ ɗa, te weɗ keeh ki.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>Ŋ kiimiɗɗi ɓa ɓeɗ dong, waaye ɓeɗ na ɓooɓi kosan ndo taamboh ŋ woo ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Baab, mi na kiimee ɗa ne ɓa jen, ɓa nik yino, findi fu nikoh nga so, ŋ nikka nga ɗa. Ŋ waaɗ ne ɓa nam nik nga ɓoo po adinaani kos ne a fu woos so. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Kiyak ki fu tum nga so, ŋ tumiɗa nga ɓa ne ɓa nik yino findi mi na ɗa nikoh yino. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Ŋ nik nga ɓa, fu nik nga so ineem tah po ɓa min nik yino keeh-keeh ne adinaani jen inah ne, a fu woos so, te fu waaɗiɗ ɓa findi fu waaɗoh ho.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>Baab, fu waaɗiɗ to bala Adina fersan, tahha po fu tumiɗ kiyak nga so. Mi yii kiim ɗa ne, ŋ ɗiski ŋ nikan, ɓooɓi fu eɗ to nam nik na so nga, ɓa min hot kiyak keem. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Baab, a fu yurah, ɓi Adina inahɗi ɗa, waaye mi, ŋ inhiɗ ɗa te taalubeeciŋ ngo ɓii, ɓa inhiɗ ne a fu woos so. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Ŋ inhiɗiɗ ɓa tiikiŋ ɗa, te ŋ hey ɓa wa ɓaate inhiɗ po waaɗi fu waaɗ to nik nga ɓa, te mi, ŋ nik nga ɓa. »<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ambuukaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo, a hunnda na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, ɓa kaɗta ɓaka winooraŋ hulɓaŋ Sederon. Nguuk nikeen nga, a aassa nga na ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe meeɗeen nik nga, tahha po Yudaa, yi na hee ɗe eɗndohe, inheen ɗiska. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>A hunnda nga na ɓi soldaar na ɓi alkaate ɓaah ŋ ɓa na niiɗe <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, e kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca tuuƴee ɓa. Ɓa ɓayya niitoha na ganaay.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yeesu inheen ini na hee ɗe rahse jen, a reɓpa nga ɓa, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na waake ya ɓa ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet. » A woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam yii. » Wa raak Yudaa yi na eɗndohee ɗe tufkiɗ na ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Wa Yeesu woo ɓa ne : « Ñam yii », ɓa dokukka finho, ɓa keennda ŋ kehƴi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yeesu meeksissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na waake ya ɓa ? » Ɓa woosa ne : « Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet. » <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ woyiɗ ɗu wa, ñam yii. Nik ne ɗu na waakee so ɗah, faɗaat ƴaaɓii ɓa coot. » <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>A woyiɗ ineem ne ina a woyee wii raak : « Baab, ŋ ñakɗi ali ɓo' ŋ ɓi fu eɗ to. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Saaŋ 6:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:12">17:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simong Piyeer nikee na ndang, a puliɗtaa, a ƴoɓpa <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ ñaam caŋ seeƴkiɗoha yakka, nofiŋ ɗe ñaahmi nguɗta. Ñaameem teeksee Malkus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Yeesu woosa Piyeer ne : « Dokna ndangiŋ ɗa ŋ holiŋ wa. Kaasiŋ miskiɗi Baabi eɗ to, ŋ joyɗaa joyɗi an e ? »<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ fiki Hannas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Ŋ ineem soldaar ca na kilifaanaŋ ɓa na alkaateecaŋ Yawuut ca, ammba Yeesu, ɓa tokka ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Ɓa koc ɗe ɓay ŋ ɗiskaŋ Hannas, baab ɓi ɓiti Kayif ; Kayif, a yi nikee seeƴkiɗoha yakka ŋ kiis kaam. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>A yi woyee kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca ne : « Ɓo' yino kaan wuu cuuɓi weɗ ngisoh. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:50">Saaŋ 11:50</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer taaskiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simong Piyeer na taalube wiiriis nikee taambɗeeɗa Yeesu. Taalubeeneem, seeƴkiɗoha yakka inheen ɗe, weɗ tah a minnda hun na Yeesu, a aassa kahan seeƴkiɗoha yakka. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Piyeer nak, a tasee ŋ nguɓu kahna ŋ sero buntaana. Taalubeena yinoora pulla, a woosa na ɓoya nikee ŋ buntaana, yeem faɗta Piyeer a aassa na taalubeena. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Kuɓka cafƴa nikee ŋ buntaana, a nikee ñaam. A woosa Piyeer ne : « Fu yii, fu namɗi ɓaah ŋ taalubeeciŋ ƴaari e ? » A woosa ne : « Muk, ŋ ɓaahɗi nga. »<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Ñaam ca na alkaateeca nikee ŋ ɗiska, ɓa ɓayee aañind, ɓa fuuɗta yongkaah, ɓa yohnukeeɗa sagu soosa. Piyeer nikka na ɓa, nameeɗa yohnuk.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hannas meeksiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Seeƴkiɗoha yakka meekissa Yeesu ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe na jangɗohiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ woyee halang ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen, ŋ jangɗoheeɗa ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci na <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, ɗisik ci Yawuut ci jen na cohe, te ŋ ɗasɗoheeɗi ali in ŋ in ci ŋ woye. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Kon wa ye tah fu meeksee so ? Meeksa ɓooɓi sikɗukee ini ŋ woo ; ɓeɗ, ɓa inhiɗ ini ŋ woo ɓa. »<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Wa a woo ineem, ƴaar ŋ alkaateeca, ya nikee ŋ serooce, kunnda ɗe paɗ, woosa ɗe ne : « Fu na hee lofohe seeƴkiɗohi yakki an e ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Nik ne ini ŋ woo, wa ɗaa haa ɗah, seede'a. Te nik ne ini ŋ woo, wa ɗaa ɗah, wee tah fu laɓpa so ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Weɗ Hannas nakoh ne Yeesu ɓaysaat ŋ Kayif seeƴkiɗoha yakka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hannas a yi nikee seeƴkiɗoha yakka, waaye e ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> nihsohee ɗe nga, tufkiɗta Kayif. Kon ŋ jamanoonaam, ɓa kanak jen, ɓa ɓeeɗkohsee seeƴkiɗoh yakak.</char></note> na yaah ciŋ ɗe tokuuɗ.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer taaskissiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Simong Piyeer risee ŋ ndaam yohnukeeɗa. Raakka ɓooɓa meekis ɗe ne : « Fu yii, fu namɗi ɓaah ŋ taalubeeciŋ ƴaari e ? » Piyeer taasukka an : « Muk, ŋ ɓaahɗi nga ɓa. » <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ƴaar, ɓaah ŋ ñaam caŋ seeƴkiɗoha yakka, nikee nga. A ɓaah na ƴaara Piyeer nguɗee nofaŋ ɗe, a woosa Piyeer ne : « Ŋ hotɗi ɗa hotɗi na ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ nguuka e ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Waaye Piyeer taaskissa. A reehiɗɗi woo, siika leehukka.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓayuuɗ ŋ fiki Pilaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Yeesu kooɗohuusa kahan Kayif, a ɓayuusa kahan Pilaat goornoora. Wa nikee na ɓaaɓ-teel. Waam, ɓa sangee raak usuɓ ne wa hondohuu ɓa ñam kañam kaŋ <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paaka</char></char> ; weɗ tahee ɓa aaseeɗi ŋ ɗooƴ kahna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yawuut ci meeɗɗi aas kahan ɓoyi nikɗi Yawuut. Ineem nikee usuɓ nga ɓa.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Weɗ Pilaat puloh, kaɗta nga ɓa, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na yambe ƴaarii ye ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A nikeeɗi tumoh moɗaaɗi ɗah, ɓoo heeɗi ɗa ɗe kome. »<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Ŋ ineem Pilaat woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓayaat ɗe, ɗu atte'oot ɗe ŋ waasiŋ ɗu. » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɗu ɓi ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char>, ɗu onɗi ɓoo ne ɓoo ap ɓo'. » <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Ineem raakka ne findi Yeesu woyee ne a kaanohan ɗaa, raak.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilaat dokkissa ŋ kahna, a ɓeeɗkiɗukka Yeesu, a woosa ɗe ne : « A fu buuriŋ Yawuut ci e ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne « Wa woo kiŋ ɗa, wala e ɓi ɓo' woo ɗa wa nga so ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilaat woosa ɗe ne : « Mi i ? Ŋ Yawuut e ? Ɓooɓiŋ ɗa na kilifaaciŋ seeƴkiɗoh ci ɓeɗ ɓay ɗa nga so. Fu tum ye ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Nguuriŋ ngo nikɗi ŋ adinaanii. Nguuriŋ ngo nikeen ŋ adinaanii ɗah, surgaaciŋ ngo heen ndo hiñohɗe po ŋ degsuu ŋ yaah ciŋ kilifaaciŋ Yawuut ci. Mbaa Nguuriŋ ngo nikɗi ŋ kehƴi ndii. » <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilaat woosa ɗe ne : « Kon fu buur e ? » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu woo ne ŋ buur. Ini tah ho hay Adina, ŋ rimukka, weɗ ne ŋ seede keeh ki. Ɓo' nu ɓaah ŋ keeh ki ɗah na sikɗuke sikɗuk woo kiŋ ngo. » <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilaat woosa ɗe ne : « Keeh ki weɗ ye ? »</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilaat eɗohiɗ Yeesu ne a daaƴu ŋ kurwaa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Wi Pilaat woo ineem, a pulla, a dokkissa ŋ Yawuut ci, a woosa ɓa ne : « Mi, ŋ hotɗi ini ƴaarii tum in moɗaaɗi po a joyya apu. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Waaye, ɗu mbaahkohiɗ ne ŋ faɗsiɗ ɗu ɓo' yino, feet <char style="tl">Paak</char> nu ree ɗah ; ɗu waaɗiɗ ne ŋ faɗsiɗ ɗu buuriŋ Yawuut ci e ? » <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Ɓa leehkisseeɗa an : « Muk ! Kinaa ɗe faɗis, faɗsiɗa ɓoo Barabaas. » Barabaas yeem nikee yoondɗoh kur.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Wa ɓa woo Pilaat ineem, a ɓayya Yeesu, a nakohha ɗe laɓɗu leraw. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Soldaar ca teɗiɗta ɗe mbahne-buur, ɓa teɗohee wa ñapir, ɓa deggaa ŋ hafiŋ ɗe, ɓa ɓekiɗta ɗe palto ruumind, ruumind buur. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Ɓa reɓeeɗa nga ɗe, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Buuriŋ Yawuut ci, ɓoo ɓii kañiɗ ɗa ! » Ɓa tipeeɗa ɗe paɗ. <verse eid="JHN 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilaat pulissa, a woosa Yawuut ca ne : « Faɗaat ŋ ɓay ɗu ɗe ŋ hari, ɗu inah ne ŋ hotɗi ali ini joy ɗe tah apu. » <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Yeesu pulla na mbahneeraŋ rupa na paltoona ruumnda. Pilaat woosa ɓa ne : « Ƴaari yeɗɗi ! »<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Wa kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca na alkaateeca hot ɗe, ɓa leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa ! Daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa ! » Pilaat woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓayaat ɗe, ɗu daaƴoot ɗe ; mi, ŋ hotɗi ini joy ɗe tah apu. » <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo, ɓoo raakiɗ waas, te wa woo ne a joy joy kaan, laam a tum haf ce <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>. »<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Wa Pilaat kerah woo keem, a ɓaatta tiit. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>A dokkissa ŋ ɗooƴ kahna a meekissa Yeesu ne : « Fu puloh nde ? » Waaye Yeesu tahasɗi ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Ŋ ndeem Pilaat woosa ɗe ne : « Fu sang woo na so e ? Fu inahɗi ne ŋ raakiɗ hatili ŋ min ɗa faɗsoh te ŋ namiɗ raak hatili ŋ min ɗa daaƴoh ŋ kurwaa e ? » <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fu heeɗi raake ali hatil nga so ne Kooh oneeɗi ɗa wa ɗah. Weɗ tah yi deg go ŋ yaah fu a yi raak bakaaɗi uup yak. »<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Ŋ woo keem, Pilaat waakeeɗa findi a faɗsohan ɗe. Waaye Yawuut ca leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Fu faɗis ɗe ɗah, fu nawle buuri yakkiŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> haa. Yaa nu tum haf ce buur ɗah, a sangiɗiŋ buuri yakki ! »<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Wa Pilaat kerah woo ceem, a ɓayya Yeesu ŋ hara, a ɓooffa ŋ atte'ohaana ŋ ɗiska na woyse "Dungohu atoh" te ŋ peɗeem Yawuut, wa na woyse "Gabata". <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Wa nikee ŋ ɓak leero noh ŋ mbeha Yawuut ca na kooɗkohe laam Kooh-wiisiina weɗ na nike <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="Paak">Paakaŋ</char></char> ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Pilaat woosa Yawuut ca ne : « Buuriŋ ɗu yeɗɗi ! » <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Waaye ɓa leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « A kaanaat ! A kaanaat ! Daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa ! » Pilaat woosa ɓa ne : « Buuriŋ ɗu, a yi mi na hee daaƴe ŋ kurwaa e ? » Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo raakɗi buur wiiriis ɗal buura yakkaŋ Rom. » <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Ŋ ndeem Pilaat eɗta ɓa Yeesu ne ɓa daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yeesu daaƴuuɗ ŋ kurwaa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Pilaat eɗta ɓa Yeesu, ɓa ɓayya ɗe, ɓa cootta na ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yeesu deguusa kurwaanaŋ ɗe, a yurahha ɗiska na woyse "Ƴoh-haf", te peɗeem Yawuut woyee wa <char style="tl">Golgota</char>. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Soldaar ca daaƴoh ɗe ndaam, a yi na ƴaar kanak yaa nu nga ŋ kurwaa, yii lahha ɗe ŋ ɓakii, yinni lahha ɗe ŋ ɓaki tas, a nikka ŋ leerooɓa.<verse eid="JHN 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilaat nakohha fiisɗu ini Yeesu nik, ŋ inaa, wa daaƴuusa ŋ ɗafuk kurwaana. Inii weɗ fiissee nga : « Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet, buuriŋ Yawuut ci. » <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yawuut laayiɗ jangeeɗa ini fiisse, ɗiska a daaƴsee useeɗi kur-taaha te wa fiissee ŋ peɗeem kaahay : peɗeem Yawuut na lateng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lateng </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ nikee peɗmaŋ ɓi Rom ŋ jamanoonaam.</char></note> na <char style="w">gerek</char>. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ Yawuut ca woosa Pilaat ne : « Kina fiis "Buuriŋ Yawuut ci", waaye fiisa ne : “ Ƴaarii woo ne a yi buuriŋ Yawuut ci. ” » <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilaat loffa ne : « Ini ŋ fiis, ŋ fiisiɗa. »<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Wa soldaar ca ƴut daaƴ Yeesu, ɓa ɓayya kulɓaacaŋ ɗe, ɓa paysohha ca ɓak nikiis, yaa nu nga ɓak yino. Ɓa nammba ɓay kulɓaakaŋ ɗe wa a na adginke, wa nikee piis yino ɗafki po kehƴi, wa raakeeɗi supit. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Ɓa woosa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ɓoo kinaata faar, ɓoo piilohaata, ɓoo inah ɓoyi raakana nga ɓoo. » Ineem raakka ne ina Fiis ci woyee raak, an : « Ɓa paysohiɗ kulɓaaciŋ ngo, ɓa piilohha ne ɓa inah yi raakan kulɓaakiŋ ngo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Sabuur 22:19</ref></char></note> » Ineem weɗ soldaar ca tum.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Yaayiŋ Yeesu, a yi na taambɗoh ce ɓitiɓ, na Mari ɓiti Kolopas, na Mari Makdala, ɓa nikee tufkiɗ ŋ sero kurwaanaŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Wa Yeesu hot yaayiŋ ɗe, a nammba hot taalubeena a keeñkohee, ŋ sero yaayiŋ ɗe, a woosa yaayiŋ ɗe ne : « Yaay, kuɓkiŋ ɗa yeɗɗeem. » <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Ƴutta a woosa taalubeena ne : « Yaayiŋ ɗa yeɗɗeem. » Ina amboh ŋ waam, taalubeena ɓayya Maryaama kahan ce, a nikka nga.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Ŋ finho ineem Yeesu inahha ne in ci jen mitiɗ kotii, a woosa ne : « Ŋ sifaɗkiɗ. » A woyiɗ ineem ne ini Fiis ci woyee<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:16">Sabuur 22:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:22">69:22</ref></char></note> raak. <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Wa raakeen ndaam meeme riifiɗ na masuɓ raakiɗ <char style="tl">bineegar</char>. Soldaar ca ɓayya daah, ɓa hooƴcaa nga, ɓa tokkaa ŋ lecem ndooɗ <char style="tl">hisoɓ</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hisoɓ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa kidig ƴin. Car ci ceɗ ɓooɓa meeɗ lisoh ne ɓa farsee ɗah. </char></note>, ɓa reɓiɗtaa ŋ nguɓiŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Wa a an nga po ƴutta, a woosa ne : « In ci jen reehiɗ haɓɗu. » Weɗ a naaroh haf, a eɗohha ruuhiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Soldaar maangiɗ Yeesu salma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Wa nikee mbehi ɓa kooɗkiɗohe <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>. Mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse wii, wa nikee mbeh yakiɗ ŋ Yawuut ci, weɗ tah kilifaacaŋ ɓa waaɗeeɗi ne mbehaam raak fiɗaaf ca ŋ ɗafuk kurwaaca. Ɓa kaɗta ŋ Pilaat, ɓa kiimmba ɗe ne kot caŋ ƴaaɓa daaƴsee weeru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓo' daaƴu ŋ kurwaa, kot ciŋ ɗe weeru ɗah, a na gaawe gaaw kaan.</char></note>, fiɗaaf caŋ ɓa nihsu. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Ŋ ineem soldaar ca kaɗta ŋ ƴaaɓa kanak ca daaƴsee na Yeesu, ɓa weerra kot caŋ ɓa. Ɓa koc weer caŋ ya koc, ɓa weerra caŋ ya kanakɗoh.<verse eid="JHN 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Wa ɓa ree ŋ Yeesu, ɓa hotta ne a kaaniɗ, tahha po ɓa weerɗi kot ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Waaye ƴaar ŋ soldaar ca, maannga ɗe salma ŋ hambuus. Jaarra wa puliɗta ñif na masuɓ.<verse eid="JHN 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Ɓoyi naandsuk in cii, a hotoot hotoot na has ciŋ ɗe te ini a woo, wa keeh. A yi ŋ haf ce, a inhiɗ ne ini a woo, wa keeh, te a seede'iɗa ne ɗu nam min kos.<verse eid="JHN 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Ineem kaɗohha ɗaa ne ini Fiis ci woyee raak, an : « Ali ƴoh yino ŋ ƴoh ciŋ ɗe weersanɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Pula 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Kind ci 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:21">Sabuur 34:21</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Te Fiis ci woyissiɗ ŋ ɗisik wiiriis ne : « Ɓa hey marke ŋ yi ɓa maange.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Sakriya 12:10</ref> </char></note> »<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓekuuɗ ŋ ruy-ruy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Wa in ceem coot, Suseef yaŋ Arimate, kiimmba Pilaat ne yeem eɗ ɗe fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu. Suseef nikee taalubeeniŋ Yeesu, waaye a ɗasɗohee wa ɗasɗoh sagu neƴƴoh kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca. Pilaat teyɗukiɗta ɗe, Suseef kaɗta, ɓayya fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nikodem nammba hay, a ɓayndohha ini ree kilo diw ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30) haɓɗohu <char style="tl">miir</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">miir</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa cuuraay, wa na fuuɗseeɗi. Wa na woyse "<char style="tl">myrrhe</char>" ŋ farañse.</char></note> na puɗ eeñɗoha na woyse <char style="tl">alowe</char>. Nikodem yeem a yi kaɗee marka Yeesu na wek.<verse eid="JHN 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ŋ ineem ɓa kanak, ɓa ɓayya fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu, ɓa lemeseeɗaa na uuf, ɓa tumeeɗaa eeñɗohaana, findi Yawuut ci na tumohe, ne ɓa heesa ɗaake fiɗaaf caŋ ɓa ɗah. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Raakeen nguuk ŋ sero ɗiska Yeesu daaƴse, ŋ ɗooƴ nguukeem raakeen ruy-ruy as wi ali ɓo' moosɗi ɗaakohu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ini Yawuut ca kooɗkiɗee mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse te ruy-ruya useeɗi ndaam, weɗ tah ɓa ɓekka fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu nga.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu hultiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Wa nikee mbehi taamb ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> na ɓaaɓa teel, raaka ris ñuus, Mari Makdala kaɗta ruy-ruyaŋ Yeesu. Wa a ree, a hotta ne atoh fa rangee wa ɓakɗuuɗ. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Weɗi a nupoh ŋ Simong Piyeer na taalubeena yinoora, yi Yeesu keeñkohee, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓa kooɗohiɗ fiɗaafiŋ Heɗi ŋ ruy-ruya, te ɓoo inahɗi ɗiski ɓa ɗaaka ! »<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Piyeer na taalubeena yinoora pulla ne ɓa kaɗ ruy-ruya. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Ɓa kanak jen, ɓa hunnda, ɓa nupeeɗa, waaye taalubeena yinoora uuppa gaaw Piyeer, a kocca ɗe ree. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>A huusukka, a hotta uufa liwsee ŋ faaniŋ ɗe, waaye a aasɗi.<verse eid="JHN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simong Piyeer nikee ñaakɗeeɗa ɗe, a reesa, a aassa, a hotta uufa deguuɗ ŋ ɗisik. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>A nammba hot wa wilɗassee ŋ hafa. Wa nikeeɗi na winoora, wa nikee lemuuɗ, wa deguusa kiik wa.<verse eid="JHN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Taalubeena yinoora hannda nam aas ; a hotta, a kossa. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Fiis ci woyeen ne Yeesu joyiɗ hulit, waaye ɓa inheeɗaa paaɗ. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Taalubeeca kanak ca haadda.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mari Makdala hotiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Waam raak Mari ŋ hara, ŋ sero ruy-ruya, fuɗeeɗa, a huusukka, a markeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴa. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>A hotta malaaka kanak ɓekkiɗ kulɓa yaanow, ɓoofiɗ ŋ ɗiska fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu degse, yinoora ɓooffa teemb ŋ ɗiska hafi nike, ya tas teemb ŋ kot ci. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓitɓi, fu na fuɗe ye ? » A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓa ɓayiɗ fiɗaafiŋ Heɗ to, te ŋ inahɗi ɗiski ɓa ɗaaka. »<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Wa a woo ineem, a heelukka, a hotta Yeesu tufkiɗ ; waaye a inhiseeɗi ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓitɓi, fu na fuɗe ye ? Fu na waake ya ɓa ? » Mari liiɓpa ne a pangkohiŋ nguuki ɓa nikoh, a loffa ne : « Kilifaani, nik ne a fu ɓay fiɗaafi ɗah, teeɓ po ɗiski fu ɗaaka, ŋ kaɗa ɓaya. »<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Mari ! » Mari wiirukka, woosa ɗe ŋ peɗeem Yawuut ne : « <char style="tl">Rabbuuni</char> ! » Wa tokis "jangɗohohi". <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kinaa so amb ndii laam ŋ rapɗi ŋ Baabi paaɗ. Waaye kaɗa ŋ ɓooɓiŋ ngo, fu woo ɓa ne mi yii rap ŋ ɗiskaŋ Baabiŋ ngo, yi nam nik Baabiŋ ɗu ; Koohiŋ ngo, yi nam nik Koohiŋ ɗu ! »<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Ŋ ineem Mari Makdala kaɗta ŋ taalubeeca, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ hotiɗ Heɗi ! » A woosa ɓa ina a woo ɗe jen.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taalubeeci hotiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Mbaɗi na niina, taalubeeca cohha ŋ kahan, ɓa rangukka nga sagu neƴƴoh kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca. Ɗekka po Yeesu nikka ŋ leerooɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Nikaat ŋ jam ! » <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>A teeɓpa ɓa ɗiski a maangsee ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe na hambuusiŋ ɗe. Ɓa summba lool ŋ hoti ɓa hot Heɗi.<verse eid="JHN 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yeesu woyissa ɓa ne : « Jam nikaat na ɗu ! Findi Baabiŋ ngo woosoh ho, mi yii nam ɗu woosoh ɗaa. » <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Ŋ finho woo keem a fuuɗissa nga ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Rahsaat <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ! <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Ɓi ɗu ɗaasan bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa hey ɗaasse. Ɓi ɗu ɗaasanɗi bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa ɗaassanɗi. »<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Tomaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Waam raak Tomaa yi na woyse Siisi te a ɓaahha ŋ taalubeeci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), a nikeeɗi na ɓa wa Yeesu hay nga ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Taalubeeci ɓinooɓi woyeeɗa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo hotiɗ Heɗi. » Waaye Tomaa loffa ɓa ne : « Feeh ŋ hotɗi daaƴohiiciŋ pontooci ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗe, ŋ ɓekɗi ndukniŋ ngo ŋ ɗiski pontooci daaƴsee te ŋ ɓekɗi yaahiŋ ngo ŋ hambuusiŋ ɗe ɗah, ŋ kosanɗi wa. »<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Mbeha dokkissa, taalubeeci cohissa ŋ kahna, Tomaa nikee na ɓa. Buntaaca jen rangseen, ɗekka po Yeesu pulla, tufukka ŋ leerooɓa. A woosa ɓa ne : « Jam nikaat na ɗu ! » <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>A hannda woo Tomaa ne : « Ɓaya ndukniŋ ɗa ndii, fu marak yaah ciŋ ngo. Raɗsa yaahiŋ ɗa fu ɓeka ŋ hambuusiŋ ngo. Kana nikis kosaaɗi, kosa kotii. » <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomaa loffa ɗe ne : « Heɗ to na Koohiŋ ngo ! » <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Hoti fu hot to, weɗ tah ɗa kos ! Ɓa neɓɗiɗ, ɓi kos te ɓa hotɗi ! »<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ini tah teerndii fiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yeesu tumissiɗ ŋ fiki taalubeeciŋ ɗe firnde wiiriis laayiɗ waaye ca fiisuuɗi ŋ teerndii. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Firndeeci fiisu cii fiisu ne ɗu kos ne Yeesu a yi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>, te koseem on ɗu kipes ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓi taalube hotiɗ Yeesu ŋ ɗiska ɓa seeɓe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Wa in ceem coot, Yeesu teeɓkissa jahran taalubeeciŋ ɗe, ŋ Cookmaŋ-Tiberiyad. A teeɓkoh ɓa an : <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simong Piyeer, na Tomaa yi na woyse Siisi, na Natanayel yi gen Kanaa ngaŋ Galile, na kuɓuuciŋ Sebede na taalube wiiriis kanak ɓeɗ nike. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simong Piyeer woosa ɓa ne : « Maa kaɗ seeɓa. » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo hey hune na ɗa. » Ɓa kaɗta. Ɓa aassa gaal, waaye ŋ weka jen ɓa ambɗi ali in.<verse eid="JHN 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Na ɓaaɓa teel Yeesu tufukka ŋ sereendaŋ cookma waaye taalubeeci inahɗi ne a yi. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Ƴaaɓiŋ ngo, ɗu raakɗi kañam ki ɓo' min ambsoh na mbuuru e ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne « A'aa ! » <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Njafaat mbaal ciŋ ɗu ŋ ɓaki ñaahmiŋ gaali, ɗu hey ambe ! » Wa ɓa njaf ca, ɓa minisɗi ca nook sagu cuurund ca laayiɗ ca ɓa ambe.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Taalubeeni Yeesu keeñkohee woosa Simong Piyeer ne : « A Heɗi ! » Wa Piyeer kerah ne a Heɗi, a tokka kulɓaakiŋ ɗe ŋ kinoh ki, raak ɗe ɓekukɗi in wiiriis ɗal kulɓaakeem, a faɗsukka ŋ masma. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Taalubeeca ɓinooɓa kaɗta teera na gaala, ɓa faseeɗa mbaala, raaka riifiɗ na cuurund. Ɓa useeɗi sereendaŋ cookma, wa joyee nik <char style="w">saangal</char> teemet.<verse eid="JHN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Wa ɓa ruhus, ɓa hotta yongkaah, ca aañind kaɓɗasse, na cuurund ŋ joli na mbuuru. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Hayaat na cuurund, ŋ ci ɗu amb. » <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simong Piyeer aassa ŋ gaala, a nookka mbaala ŋ hara. Wa riiffa na cuurund yakak teemet na ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus na kaahay (153), te ina ca laayee jen, mbaala faarkeeɗi.<verse eid="JHN 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Hayaat ɗu malnduk. » Ali taalube kaañɗi ɗe meekis ne : « A fu ɓa ? » Ɓa inheen ne a Heɗi. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yeesu reɓpa, a ɓayya mbuurnda, a eɗta ɓa, a nammba ɓa eɗ cuurnda.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Wii nikka waasi kaahayɗohi Yeesu teeɓuk taalubeeciŋ ɗe, ŋ finho hultiɗuukiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Piyeer na taalubeena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Wa ɓa malnduk po ɓa ƴutta, Yeesu woosa Simong Piyeer ne : « Simong kuɓkiŋ Saaŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Saaŋ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Saaŋ yii, baab ɓi Simong Piyeer, a ɓaahɗi na Saaŋ yi fiis teerndii. Ɓa ɓaah tiik dong.</char></note>, fu keeñkohiɗ to keeñkohi uup wi ɓooɓii raak nga so e ? » Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « Ee Heɗi, fu inhiɗ ne ŋ waaɗiɗ ɗa. » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Taambkoha buul ciŋ mbaal ciŋ ngo. »<verse eid="JHN 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>A kanakɗukissa a woosa ɗe ne : « Simong kuɓkiŋ Saaŋ, fu keeñkohiɗ to e ? » Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « Ee Heɗi, fu inhiɗ ne ŋ waaɗiɗ ɗa. » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Niiɗa mbaal ciŋ ngo. »<verse eid="JHN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>A kaahayɗukissa hooso an : « Simong kuɓkiŋ Saaŋ, fu waaɗiɗ to e ? » Piyeer soossa ŋ meeksohi kaahayɗoh an : « Fu waaɗiɗ to e ? » A loffa ɗe ne : « Heɗi, fu inhiɗ in nu nik, fu inhiɗ ne ŋ waaɗiɗ ɗa. » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Taambkoha mbaal ciŋ ngo. »<verse eid="JHN 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>A degga nga ne « Ñam na woyee ɗa wa te amba ne wa keeh, wi fu nik komaaki yaf tokootee ñooriŋ ɗa, fu kaɗeeɗa ɗiski neɓ ɗa ; waaye fu yaɓko ɗah, fu hey raɗse yaah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">raɗis yaah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ jamanoonaam, "raɗis yaah" nikee woyohaaɗ nga ɓa. Wa mineen tokis woo kii : "daaƴu ŋ kurwaa".</char></note> ciŋ ɗa, ɓo' wiiriis tokiɗ ɗa wa, a ɓay ɗa ɗiski fu waaɗɗi. » <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Ŋ woo ceem, a teeɓohee findi Piyeer na hee kaanohe, na findi a yakɗohan Kooh nga. Yeesu ɓaatta nga ne : « Ñaakiɗ to. »<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Piyeer guridda, a hotta taalubeeni Yeesu keeñkohee hayeeɗa ŋ finhooce, a taalubeeni hiiree ŋ Yeesu wa ɓa ñame, a meekissa ɗe yi eɗndohan ɗe. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Wa Piyeer hot ɗe, Piyeer woosa Yeesu ne : « Heɗi ! Moo ini kaɗ ŋ yii nak ? » <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Nik ne ŋ waaɗiɗ ne a ris pes po mbaɗna ŋ hayissan ɗah, waas fu ye nga ? Fu, ñaakiɗ to rek ! »<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Wa pasarkohha ŋ kosiɗ ca ne taalubeeneem kaananɗi. Te kat Yeesu woyeeɗi Piyeer ne a kaananɗi, a woyee ɗe inii : « Nik ne ŋ waaɗiɗ ne a ris pes po mbaɗna ŋ hayissan ɗah, waas fu ye nga ? »<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Taalubeeneem a yi fiis in ceem, a seede'iɗ ca, te ɓoo inhiɗ ne seedeeniŋ ɗe keeh.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yeesu haɓɗeen in wiiriis laayiɗ, ca fiisseen yino yino ɗah, ŋ liiɓiɗ ne teereeci hee fiisse heeɗi haɓe ŋ Adina.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
